(N'605048ac-981f-5ab9-bfcd-b554a628d0a6',N'3456958c-d09c-5d6d-bffa-68133f6106da',0,3,19,N'<h3>Health and Fitness Centre</h3><p><span>MEMBERSHIP</span></p><p>Family membership (2 adults + 2 children) costs £ }{SPACE}{ </p><p>annually Membership includes free }{SPACE}{ </p><p>Membership charges may be increased in }{SPACE}{ </p><p><span>FACILITIES</span></p><p><span>Swimming</span></p><p>Main pool with a }{SPACE}{ </p><p>Children''s pool roof</p><p><span>Gym</span></p><p>Membership includes an }{SPACE}{ session</p><p>Some equipment has }{SPACE}{ available for users</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là 285 - Script nói rõ giá family membership là 285 pounds annually.</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ family membership (n): gói gia đình </p><p>+ annually (adv): hàng năm</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,0,1982),
(N'45f86a95-d160-5e6f-90f0-23c1d6fe57cd',N'3456958c-d09c-5d6d-bffa-68133f6106da',0,3,19,N'Question number 2',N'<p>Đáp án là parking - “That''s free” liên quan trực tiếp đến parking (chỗ đỗ xe).</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ parking (n): chỗ đỗ xe </p><p>+ free (adj): miễn phí</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,2,NULL,0,1982),
(N'f1a6d716-2738-546f-99d3-3ccc1967c08e',N'3456958c-d09c-5d6d-bffa-68133f6106da',0,3,19,N'Question number 3',N'<p>- Đáp án là September </p><p>- Giá có thể tăng vào tháng 9.</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ fixed (adj): cố định </p><p>+ go up (v): tăng</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,3,NULL,0,1982),
(N'e45a076e-c3f2-50a9-bf65-7dab4437e0f1',N'3456958c-d09c-5d6d-bffa-68133f6106da',0,3,19,N'Question number 4',N'<p>- Đáp án là roof - “roof is all made of glass” → đặc điểm chính của hồ bơi.</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ roof (n): mái </p><p>+ glass (n): kính</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,4,NULL,0,1982),
(N'b95dcbde-4a3c-52e4-b471-25e6447360a4',N'3456958c-d09c-5d6d-bffa-68133f6106da',0,3,19,N'Question number 5',N'<p>- Đáp án là orientation - “session for orientation” → buổi hướng dẫn.</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ orientation (n): hướng dẫn </p><p>+ equipment (n): thiết bị</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,5,NULL,0,1982),
(N'f98e4299-01a4-5a17-a4a6-41b3b44c8f05',N'3456958c-d09c-5d6d-bffa-68133f6106da',0,3,19,N'Question number 6',N'<p>- Đáp án là TV - “TV installed on some of the equipment” → thiết bị có TV.</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ TV (n): tivi </p><p>+ installed (v): lắp đặt</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,6,NULL,0,1982),
(N'8551b63c-59bd-55e8-a16a-957d5aad5949',N'4ce94a14-c4a2-5dd6-9cbd-e6ac789a3b7a',0,2,18,N'<p>Complete the table below
