(N'bdead111-93fd-57b7-bc37-99b0de5e227a',N'a1215685-9168-55fc-9b4f-d80a0f204d91',0,3,19,N'<p>Local food: }{SPACE}{ </p><p>Type of ballgame: }{SPACE}{ </p><p>Location of recommended restaurant: by the }{SPACE}{ </p> }{SPACE}{ produced locally has a different taste</p><p>Special trip: by }{SPACE}{ </p><p>Each village has a }{SPACE}{ </p><p>Theme Park offers games and a }{SPACE}{ of pirates</p><p><span>Special activities</span></p><ul><li><p>Tashika Island:</p></li></ul> }{SPACE}{ </p><ul><li><p>A good place for</p></li></ul> }{SPACE}{ </p><ul><li><p>Stone mountains: camping is not available now</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Bring your own</p></li></ul> }{SPACE}{ </p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là cheese - Script nói rõ “try the local cheese” → món ăn địa phương.</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ local (adj): địa phương </p><p>+ cheese (n): phô mai</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,0,1981),
