entre from the entrance. </p><p>The area is surrounded by trees, so it''s a lovely shady area to watch baby turtles interacting with each other. If you''re looking for a souvenir or a memento of your experience, then we hope you''ll like our new gift shop. It used to be on the left of the entrance as you came in, in that circular shaped building, but as we expanded, we had to move it. To find it, from the entrance, take the first right off Turtle Avenue and then turn right again. It''s not far from the meeting area. Some of you may be interested in our brand new conference hall, which has state-of-the-art facilities. It''s the second building you come to on your right from the entrance. The square one, just before the amphitheater. It also has a deck with views of the beach and ocean. That is the end of Part 2. You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to Part 2</p>'),NULL,N'https://ieltsroom.com/upload/audio/iL-full-test/ieltsadvancedtest/vol-6/iL.VOL6.9.S1981.PART2.mp3',NULL,1,0,2,NULL,0,1981),
