(N'135ba6a5-0435-5a58-9aa3-3a716e6c9302',N'3198a246-b95c-57e3-a64f-e5d897a0a928',0,3,19,N'<p>Why did Cox leave his job at the theatre company?</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là B - “personal disagreements with the other scene painters” → không hòa hợp với đồng nghiệp. </p><p>- A sai vì “he apparently enjoyed travelling”. </p><p>- C sai vì “didn''t feel it was beneath him”.</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ disagreements (n): bất đồng </p><p> +colleagues (n): đồng nghiệp</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,21,NULL,0,1981),
