ty of having late-night showings, but that''s unlikely to happen in the coming year. So, as I say, if anyone''s interested in submitting a film for our competition, go on to our website and you''ll be able to access everything..</p>'),NULL,N'https://ieltsroom.com/upload/audio/iL-full-test/ieltsadvancedtest/vol-6/iL.VOL6.8.S1980.PART2.mp3',NULL,1,0,2,NULL,0,1980),
