(N'52518538-c180-5405-b49e-0ba8f68437e5',N'4261d5c7-44e9-507a-a89c-e862e4301999',0,3,19,N'<p>What TWO main criteria are used to judge the film competition?</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là D </p><p>- “good photography, conveying things visually” → quality of photography. </p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ photography (n): quay/chụp hình </p><p>+ visually (adv): bằng hình ảnh</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,17,NULL,0,1980),
