Choose the correct letter <span>A, B </span>or<span> C.</span></p>',N'',N'',N'',N'MUFS',1,0,1,NULL,0,1979),
(N'6633bf86-2e09-5e36-bfed-60d6956d1dff',N'44f40d8f-834f-5e3c-8c96-7351dc9a7399',0,3,19,N'<p>Who founded the Middletown Urban Farming Scheme?</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là B - Script khẳng định rõ: “a group of… business people… decided to create MUFS”. </p><p>- A sai vì “university specialists… got involved later” (tham gia sau, không phải người sáng lập). </p><p>- C sai vì “town planners” chỉ có ý tưởng trước đó, không trực tiếp thành lập.</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ create (v): tạo ra </p><p>+ business people (n): doanh nhân</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,11,NULL,0,1979),
(N'38aa9b13-da39-5130-85e7-9c4048abe8a6',N'44f40d8f-834f-5e3c-8c96-7351dc9a7399',0,3,19,N'<p>What was the original reason for starting the MUFS?</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là A - “maximize the utilization of… land” = sử dụng đất hiệu quả hơn. </p><p>- B sai vì script nói rõ “not… reducing CO2 emissions”. </p><p>- C sai vì “healthier diet” chỉ là lợi ích sau này.</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ maximize (v): tối đa hóa </p><p>+ utilization (n): sự sử dụng</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,12,NULL,0,1979),
(N'd1a17ad8-d2ad-590b-b87c-d9462ed318b7',N'44f40d8f-834f-5e3c-8c96-7351dc9a7399',0,3,19,N'<p>For the coming year, the MUFS will focus on recruiting members from</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là C - Script: “concentrate on getting various community centers”. </p><p>- A và B sai vì schools và companies đã tham gia rồi (“we''ve got… schools… corporate employees”).</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ concentrate on (v): tập trung vào </p><p>+ community centres (n): trung tâm cộng đồng</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,13,NULL,0,1979),
(N'8f91f28a-f559-5087-8f84-dc18e7706914',N'44f40d8f-834f-5e3c-8c96-7351dc9a7399',0,3,19,N'<p>What kind of information is available from members of the MUFS committee?</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là A - “hands-on suggestions” = lời khuyên thực tế → practical gardening tips. </p><p>- B sai vì họ không biết “technical questions”. - C không được nhắc đến.</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ hands-on (adj): thực tế </p><p>+ suggestions (n): lời khuyên</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,14,NULL,0,1979),
(N'b4f8da6a-35b7-59d8-bf56-41d5452b935e',N'44f40d8f-834f-5e3c-8c96-7351dc9a7399',0,3,19,N'<p>What are provided by the MUFS for the physically disabled?</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là B - Script: “window boxes… larger containers… free of charge” → containers for plants. </p><p>- A sai vì “soil and compost… provide their own”. - C sai vì tools mới “planned” (chưa có).</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ containers (n): chậu/trồng cây </p><p>+ free of charge (phr): miễn phí</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,15,NULL,0,1979),
(N'db491aa0-b86d-5ea4-8fb3-02f1a8ac35c9',N'44f40d8f-834f-5e3c-8c96-7351dc9a7399',0,3,19,N'<p>According to school teachers, what has been an unexpected advantage of the
MUFS?</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là C - “change in attitude” → ý thức cộng đồng tốt hơn.</p><p> - A sai vì đã “knew… practical use in science classes” (không bất ngờ).</p><p> - B sai vì “haven''t provided cheaper lunches”.</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ anticipate (v): dự đoán trước </p><p>+ attitude (n): thái độ</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,16,NULL,0,1979),
(N'f069109c-0f4a-53b5-8e8e-e33909145dde',N'd1fac326-50e3-5d4b-b720-3576fd86c417',0,2,18,N'<p>What free goods or services are offered by each of the following providers?</p><p>Choose <span><span>FOUR</span></span> answers from the box and write the correct letter <span><span>A–F</span></span> next to questions 17–20.</p>',N'',N'',N'',N'Free goods or services',15,0,2,NULL,0,1979),
