 Peter: I''m thinking about Vortex, but I haven''t got anything useful from its website.<br>
 Shona: I worked there last summer. It''s an international company with headquarters in Spain, so most of the managers here speak Spanish.<br>
 Shona: Thanks to the internship experience, I became f'+N'luent in it.<br>
 Peter: Right. That''s not for me.</p><p>
