(N'0ea26fbe-159e-59f5-8923-fe0afa66cec6',N'5e772504-ca09-53d3-8a6c-6be9a66f541f',0,3,19,N'<h3>The Red Sea Urchin</h3><p><span>Background</span></p><p>The red sea urchin:</p><p>• feeds on }{SPACE}{ </p><p>• is covered in }{SPACE}{ that protect it</p><p>• used to be regarded as a }{SPACE}{ </p><p>From 1970s onwards:</p><p>• it became clear that }{SPACE}{ was an important market for red sea urchins</p><p>• scientific interest increased because of a }{SPACE}{ in red sea urchin population </p><p><span>Research findings</span></p><p><em>Study based on biochemical techniques</em></p><p>Red sea urchins:</p><p>• grow very slowly</p><p>• live a very long time (maximum life span: up to }{SPACE}{ )</p><p>• can be harvested only after 6-7 years</p><p>• after 22 years, only grow }{SPACE}{ per year</p><p><em>Study measuring radio carbon</em></p><p>• no evidence of }{SPACE}{ when sea urchins die</p><p>• they can still }{SPACE}{ and grow when very old</p><p>• growth not connected to }{SPACE}{ or other external factors</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là plants - “grazes on plants” → ăn thực vật </p><p>- Khớp với “feeds on …”</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ graze (v): ăn cỏ </p><p>+ herbivore (n): động vật ăn cỏ</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,31,NULL,0,1977),
(N'905db37f-abb4-5a7a-89e2-a2ff614f4705',N'5e772504-ca09-53d3-8a6c-6be9a66f541f',0,3,19,N'Question number 32',N'<p>- Đáp án là spines - “covered in spines” → được bao phủ bởi gai</p><p>- Key word:</p><p> + spines (n): gai</p><p> + predators (n): động vật săn mồi</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,32,NULL,0,1977),
(N'9755855e-6d3a-54df-b788-84c855c6010a',N'5e772504-ca09-53d3-8a6c-6be9a66f541f',0,3,19,N'Question number 33',N'<p>- Đáp án là pest - “considered to be a pest” → bị coi là sinh vật gây hại </p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ pest (n): sinh vật gây hại </p><p>+ considered (v): được coi là</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,33,NULL,0,1977),
(N'abe56b37-5c20-546d-973f-71c7f45f0d2b',N'5e772504-ca09-53d3-8a6c-6be9a66f541f',0,3,19,N'Question number 34',N'<p>- Đáp án là Asia - “demand… in Asia” → thị trường ở châu Á</p><p> - Key word: + demand (n): nhu cầu + delicacy (n): món ngon</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,34,NULL,0,1977),
