(N'1e74620e-bd56-5eb0-b75e-20de026baed5',N'f3647e7e-ca1d-52eb-90c7-d279a7461b20',0,3,19,N'<p>According to Dominic, what is surprising about the supermarket garden project?</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là B </p><p>- “didn’t expect” = surprising → điều bất ngờ là “hugely popular with local chefs” </p><p>- A sai vì khách hàng “love the idea” (không phải unpopular) </p><p>- C sai vì “only a few shops” → không phải nhiều</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ popular (adj): phổ biến </p><p>+ chefs (n): đầu bếp</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,21,NULL,0,1881),
(N'f4f69419-76a5-5467-9f14-4a77a833322f',N'f3647e7e-ca1d-52eb-90c7-d279a7461b20',0,3,19,N'<p>What do the speakers identify as a possible problem with the solar carpark idea?</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là C - “difficulty = finding space” → thiếu không gian </p><p>- A sai vì “technology seems to be all there” (không có vấn đề công nghệ) </p><p>- B sai vì không đề cập chi phí cao</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ space (n): không gian </p><p>+ panels (n): tấm pin</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,22,NULL,0,1881),
(N'2652b017-ec5a-5915-abf1-46317109c19a',N'f3647e7e-ca1d-52eb-90c7-d279a7461b20',0,3,19,N'<p>According to the speakers, the unexpected benefit of wildlife crossings is that</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là B </p><p>- “genetic diversity… has improved” → đa dạng di truyền tăng </p><p>- Đây là lợi ích “unexpected” (ít ai nghĩ tới) - C sai vì giảm tai nạn là “predicted outcome” </p><p>- A sai vì không nhắc đến chi phí rẻ hơn</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ genetic diversity (n): đa dạng di truyền </p><p>+ habitat (n): môi trường sống</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,23,NULL,0,1881),
(N'9c065ad0-705d-56d0-b0fa-9a98b821089a',N'f3647e7e-ca1d-52eb-90c7-d279a7461b20',0,3,19,N'<p>What is impressive about the 100% renewable energy campaign?</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là C </p><p>- Nhấn mạnh “amount of support offered” → mức hỗ trợ cao - A sai vì “only a few countries” -</p><p> B sai vì không nói nhanh hay chậm</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ support (n): hỗ trợ </p><p>+ community (n): cộng đồng</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,24,NULL,0,1881),
(N'd1faad6c-1332-5ee8-bd79-9369695dd0e3',N'f3647e7e-ca1d-52eb-90c7-d279a7461b20',0,3,19,N'<p>What positive point about "carrot-mobbing" does Ella describe?</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là A </p><p>- “use profits to support environmental projects” → giúp doanh nghiệp thực hiện dự án xanh </p><p>- B sai vì không nhấn vào việc mua sản phẩm bền vững </p><p>- C sai vì “don’t get to know each other personally”</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ profits (n): lợi nhuận </p><p>+ initiatives (n): sáng kiến</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,25,NULL,0,1881),
(N'fdd6e4b5-5fff-5bde-950e-4f2ff76f208e',N'78888bcc-35c1-5ab5-8a7e-9428c03a87cc',0,2,18,N'<p>Complete the flow-chart below.</p><p>Drag the correct word or phrase from the list into each gap.</p>',N'',N'',N'',N'Aerial Reforestation Process',13,0,2,NULL,0,1881),
(N'c446cb9e-42f4-57f6-88bb-2bc6e3304405',N'fdd6e4b5-5fff-5bde-950e-4f2ff76f208e',0,3,19,N'<h3>Aerial Reforestation Process</h3><p>Choose a reforestation area with plenty of }{SPACE}{ </p><p>Take a lot of suitable }{SPACE}{ , appropriate to your purposes.</p><p>Mix with long-lasting }{SPACE}{ </p><p>Press into lumps of }{SPACE}{ </p><p>Apply an outer coating, e.g. paper, to provide appropriate levels of }{SPACE}{ and protection.</p><p>Just before dropping it from the plane, make sure it has enough water.</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là H (light) </p><p>- “ensuring there''s enough light” → điều kiện cần</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ light (n): ánh sáng </p><p>+ crucial (adj): quan trọng</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,26,NULL,0,1881),
(N'4afd97e2-38e0-5bc7-8c8e-2135b4562cf2',N'fdd6e4b5-5fff-5bde-950e-4f2ff76f208e',0,3,19,N'Question number 27',N'<p>- Đáp án là C (seeds) </p><p>- “make sure you have the right seeds” → chọn hạt giống phù hợp</p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ seeds (n): hạt giống </p><p>+ competition (n): cạnh tranh</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,27,NULL,0,1881),
