now that only through hard work can I excel in any field. I just have so much trouble making up my mind. I know there will be funding and scholarships available for particular courses, but I can''t choose. By all means, discuss your concerns with other teachers. They''re all quite busy, you know. I''ll think about it. Thank you so much for your advice, Professor Frazier. You'+N' are welcome. If you- </p><p><span>That''s the end of part three. You now have half a minute to check your answers. </span></p>'),NULL,N'https://ieltsroom.com/upload/audio/iL-full-test/ieltsadvancedtest/vol-3/iL.VOL3.5.S1673.PART3.mp3',NULL,1,0,3,NULL,0,1673),
