(N'de70542b-1919-54a4-bcdb-c829d26bf358',N'0b72c17e-388d-5e5d-baae-cd4e7b0225bd',0,3,19,N'<h3>History of the Area</h3><p>• 2500 years ago. in Peter Rochet''s findings: Roman trading }{SPACE}{ for grains in Turenne.</p><p>• In the 1500s, a French found the remains of a }{SPACE}{ </p><p>• After that, British and Swedish archeologists conducted a full }{SPACE}{ in this area.</p>',N'<p>Câu hỏi: “Roman trading ___ for grains in Turenne.” </p><p>→ Từ khóa traded their pottery for grains. </p><p>Nghĩa: người La Mã trao đổi đồ gốm lấy ngũ cốc. </p><p>Từ vựng: pottery = đồ gốm.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,31,NULL,0,1668),
(N'067d2f87-7a28-5fbe-8cc1-ce1baf13fb42',N'0b72c17e-388d-5e5d-baae-cd4e7b0225bd',0,3,19,N'Question number 32',N'<p>Câu hỏi: “In the 1500s, a French found the remains of a ___.” </p><p>→ Từ khóa remains of a castle. </p><p>Nghĩa: tàn tích của lâu đài.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,32,NULL,0,1668),
