(N'e595d21d-84aa-519e-8296-a30ffb835d8d',N'750da8bf-2704-58eb-96b3-15240b828f02',0,3,19,N'<p>Why does Brad say that it is essential to write an outline?</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là C vì Brad nói rõ
