(N'1f886872-391c-5575-a3da-26a14dc2d643',N'750da8bf-2704-58eb-96b3-15240b828f02',0,3,19,N'<p>Why is it important to write the speech out, word for word?</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là A vì việc viết ra
