in the past two years</p><p>• this philosophy signals that a }{SPACE}{ can be from any part of the
company</p><p>• grades are not used to decide about }{SPACE}{ </p><p><span>Features of the managing style</span></p><p>• answering emails personally</p><p>• setting up an online forum for complaints, each of which is called a }{SPACE}{ </p><p>• any complaint can be posted, e.g. air conditioning, food or }{SPACE}{ entitlement</p><p>• a }{SPACE}{ on anonymous complaints was introduced</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là democratic vì
người nói nhấn mạnh mục
