pickers.</p><p><span>Mrs. Chandler:</span> I''m afraid not. You''ll need to bring your own food for lunch, and more importantly, enough water to last a full day. It can get very hot, so drinking is vital.</p><p><span>Ben Miller: </span>Right, like back home. Okay, well, thanks for all the information. What happens now?</p><p><span>Mrs. Chandler:</span> Well, I''ll post a co'+N'ntract to you.</p><p><span><span>That is the end of Section 1. You now have half a minute to check your answers.</span></span></p>'),NULL,N'https://ieltsroom.com/upload/audio/iL-full-test/ieltsadvancedtest/vol-1/iL.VOL1.1.S1641.PART1.mp3',NULL,1,0,1,NULL,0,1641),
