(N'245cb948-5ccc-589f-80c5-31209197785d',N'4ac6d283-0d3a-5a91-ba2e-efd4d496cc16',0,3,19,N'<h3>History of the Area</h3><p>• 2500 years ago. in Peter Rochet''s findings: Roman trading }{SPACE}{ for grains in Turenne.</p><p>• In the 1500s, a French found the remains of a }{SPACE}{ </p><p>• After that, British and Swedish archeologists conducted a full }{SPACE}{ in this area.</p>',N'<p>Câu hỏi: “Roman trading ___ for grains in Turenne.” </p><p>→ Từ khóa traded their pottery for grains. </p><p>Nghĩa: người La Mã trao đổi đồ gốm lấy ngũ cốc. </p><p>Từ vựng: pottery = đồ gốm.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,31,NULL,0,1586),
