(N'e65a7e0e-e2ac-53d7-aed6-5beacee61612',N'ce2f4cce-c669-5715-9275-d084f43b302b',0,1,13,(CAST(N'<h2>Driver Support</h2><p>Hi there, I''m John Blake. A friend of mine recommended your service. I''m in need of assistance. My friend mentioned that you have tow trucks capable of safely pulling cars. Nice to meet you, John. Before we proceed, we''ll need your contact details to fill out our service form and dispatch our staff. Sure. I live at 116 Charlecote Road in Salisbury. C-H-A-R-L-E-C-O-T-E. Thank you for providing your address, John. This will help us keep your information up to date. Could you also provide me with your postcode so that we can send you detailed service information by email? My postcode is SE13AL. Perfect, we have that noted down. Now, could you please let me know the make of your car? This will help us send mechanics with relevant experience. I drive a Honda Accord. I bought it last year. It''s brand new. Great, we have that information on file now. Lastly, could you please provide me with the registration number of your car? This will make it easier for us to locate your vehicle. The registration number is S232TAT. Thank you, it''s been noted down. If it''s helpful, could you also tell us the color of your car? The car was originally red, but my wife recently painted it green. Thank you for sharing that detail, John. It will definitely help with vehicle identification. Now, could you please briefly explain what happened? It''s possible that my vehicle is running low on oil. I only realized it after I began driving on the motorway and couldn''t find a gas station. That''s when I decided to exit the motorway. I see. We''ll make sure to bring some fuel. Please continue. I wasn''t familiar with the road conditions, and when I was searching for a station to refuel my car, I got it stuck in the mud. I''m sorry to hear that. Are you currently in a safe location? Yes, I''m near a bridge. I spotted a road sign around 100 meters away indicating that it''s Albany Road. All right, let''s organize assistance for you. Is there any urgency? Yes, my mother has a back injury and is unable to move. I wanted to call an ambulance, but she refused. She believes she will recover soon. I''m sorry to hear about your mother''s condition. Let me dispatch help right away. Given the distance, it will take our mechanics approximately 40 minutes to reach your location. Thank you, although it''s quite a distance. I can''t spot any convenience stores nearby, and the wind is really strong today. I understand. Please make sure your mother is comfortable. My suggestion is to find a wa' AS nvarchar(max))+N'rm place where you can take care of her. Your mother''s well-being is our top priority. Thank you for your understanding and prompt response. I really appreciate your support. I''ll keep you informed of any updates or changes. Now turn to part three. You will hear two students and their teacher discussing a field trip that the students are going to.</p>'),(CAST(N'<p>Hi there, I''m John Blake. A friend of mine recommended your service. I''m in need of assistance. My friend mentioned that you have tow trucks capable of safely pulling cars. Nice to meet you, John. Before we proceed, we''ll need your contact details to fill out our service form and dispatch our staff. Sure. I live at 116 Charlecote Road in Salisbury. C-H-A-R-L-E-C-O-T-E. Thank you for providing your address, John. This will help us keep your information up to date. Could you also provide me with your postcode so that we can send you detailed service information by email? My postcode is SE13AL. Perfect, we have that noted down. Now, could you please let me know the make of your car? This will help us send mechanics with relevant experience. I drive a Honda Accord. I bought it last year. It''s brand new. Great, we have that information on file now. Lastly, could you please provide me with the registration number of your car? This will make it easier for us to locate your vehicle. The registration number is S232TAT. Thank you, it''s been noted down. If it''s helpful, could you also tell us the color of your car? The car was originally red, but my wife recently painted it green. Thank you for sharing that detail, John. It will definitely help with vehicle identification. Now, could you please briefly explain what happened? It''s possible that my vehicle is running low on oil. I only realized it after I began driving on the motorway and couldn''t find a gas station. That''s when I decided to exit the motorway. I see. We''ll make sure to bring some fuel. Please continue. I wasn''t familiar with the road conditions, and when I was searching for a station to refuel my car, I got it stuck in the mud. I''m sorry to hear that. Are you currently in a safe location? Yes, I''m near a bridge. I spotted a road sign around 100 meters away indicating that it''s Albany Road. All right, let''s organize assistance for you. Is there any urgency? Yes, my mother has a back injury and is unable to move. I wanted to call an ambulance, but she refused. She believes she will recover soon. I''m sorry to hear about your mother''s condition. Let me dispatch help right away. Given the distance, it will take our mechanics approximately 40 minutes to reach your location. Thank you, although it''s quite a distance. I can''t spot any convenience stores nearby, and the wind is really strong today. I understand. Please make sure your mother is comfortable. My suggestion is to find a warm place where you can ' AS nvarchar(max))+N'take care of her. Your mother''s well-being is our top priority. Thank you for your understanding and prompt response. I really appreciate your support. I''ll keep you informed of any updates or changes. Now turn to part three. You will hear two students and their teacher discussing a field trip that the students are going to.</p>'),NULL,N'https://ieltsroom.com/upload/audio/iL-full-test/ieltsadvancedtest/vol-2/iL.VOL2.6.S1585.PART1.mp3',NULL,1,0,1,NULL