(N'434ad83b-d5b7-5a22-a4d2-3de428efa7f4',N'17731e53-cd1a-54d3-804b-7168985dc514',0,3,19,N'<h3>Our Geography Field Trip</h3><p>Our field trip is focused on the River Stour, which runs near to where we live (handy for }{SPACE}{ )</p><p>Starting at the }{SPACE}{ of the river, we''ll evaluate how the River Stour functions as part of the local area''s watersheds.</p><p>We''ll need to take water samples, but to find information on }{SPACE}{ , we''ll need to visit the National River Authority in Stourbridge.</p><p>A helpful water officer will meet us on our visit there and give us access to the }{SPACE}{ to find the data that we need.</p><p>Watersheds involve a variety of water systems, but we''ll focus on the River Stour''s }{SPACE}{ <span>in</span> the area''s watersheds rather than study the entire system.</p>',N'<p>Đáp án là secondary visits. Giải thích logic vì việc sống gần con sông giúp thuận tiện cho những lần quay lại thu thập dữ liệu bổ sung trong quá trình làm dự án. Key words not far, help us, secondary visits</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,21,NULL,0,1585),
