(N'433802be-1725-5102-bc93-b23b3d99109e',N'359fe400-d9fe-5d9e-b7d7-8c528c52ff86',0,3,19,N'<p><span>Key features of garbage containers:</span></p><p>Sturdy and }{SPACE}{ </p><p><span>Three kinds:</span></p><p><span>Waste sorting</span></p><ul><li><p>Recyclable garbage (blue or green bin)</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Unrecyclable garbage (yellow bin)</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Toxic waste (red bin)</p></li></ul><p><span>Waste collection</span></p><ul><li><p>Commercial waste collection:</p></li></ul><p>• It mainly refers to  }{SPACE}{ waste.</p><p>• Warning signs state not to }{SPACE}{ blue/green bins.</p><p>• Those }{SPACE}{ metals will cause environmental pollution.</p><ul><li><p>Household waste collection:</p></li></ul><p>• All kitchen garbage should be put into a }{SPACE}{ bag.</p><p><span>Waste disposal</span></p><ul><li><p>The garbage disposal plant is situated in an</p></li></ul> }{SPACE}{ space or field.</p><ul><li><p>The waste is disposed of at least once every</p></li></ul> }{SPACE}{ </p><ul><li><p>The dustbin should be cleared at night because of</p></li></ul> }{SPACE}{ </p><ul><li><p>The waste is mainly produced by</p></li></ul> }{SPACE}{ , industry, retail, and offices.</p><ul><li><p>Please do not dispose of</p></li></ul> }{SPACE}{ in any of the bins.</p>',N'<p>Đáp án là waterproof. Người nói nhấn mạnh các thùng rác phải chịu được mưa nắng khi để ngoài đường ban đêm, nên cần có đặc tính chống nước để nước không lọt vào trong thùng. Key words: waterproof: chống nước, rain: mưa.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,11,NULL,0,1567),
(N'af561e02-b3ae-520f-b1e5-a35a45522efc',N'359fe400-d9fe-5d9e-b7d7-8c528c52ff86',0,3,19,N'Question number 12',N'<p>Đáp án là paper. Trong thu gom rác thương mại, phần lớn rác thải từ các tòa nhà là giấy, và loại rác này được cho vào thùng xanh hoặc xanh dương. Key words: majority: phần lớn, building waste: rác từ tòa nhà.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,12,NULL,0,1567),
(N'b17b1c06-cb0b-569c-9d85-176a6911c65e',N'359fe400-d9fe-5d9e-b7d7-8c528c52ff86',0,3,19,N'Question number 13',N'<p>Đáp án là overfill. Các biển cảnh báo trong tòa nhà nhắc không được làm đầy quá mức thùng xanh hoặc xanh dương vì sẽ gây khó khăn cho việc thu gom. Key words: warn: cảnh báo, overfill: đổ quá đầy</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,13,NULL,0,1567),
(N'54d64380-45a1-5d0b-aa5c-72f5e2b2de2f',N'359fe400-d9fe-5d9e-b7d7-8c528c52ff86',0,3,19,N'Question number 14',N'<p>Đáp án là heavy. Người nói giải thích rằng các kim loại nặng như chì và đồng gây ô nhiễm môi trường, vì vậy cần được xử lý riêng. Key words: heavy metals: kim loại nặng, pollution: ô nhiễm.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,14,NULL,0,1567),
(N'f3c33d3b-a818-5361-b698-5c9cf86de6a2',N'359fe400-d9fe-5d9e-b7d7-8c528c52ff86',0,3,19,N'Question number 15',N'<p>Đáp án là plastic. Rác nhà bếp được yêu cầu cho vào túi nhựa để việc thu gom dễ dàng hơn và giảm mùi hôi thối. Key words: plastic bag: túi nhựa, kitchen waste: rác nhà bếp.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,15,NULL,0,1567),
(N'c08a34d2-e24d-5b82-bb2f-140419ab4277',N'359fe400-d9fe-5d9e-b7d7-8c528c52ff86',0,3,19,N'Question number 16',N'<p>Đáp án là open. Các nhà máy xử lý rác được đặt ở khu vực trống trải, xa khu dân cư và văn phòng. Key words: open space: không gian trống, disposal plant: nhà máy xử lý rác</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,16,NULL,0,1567),
(N'72c53577-7971-5bc1-bbf1-9d8013276c00',N'359fe400-d9fe-5d9e-b7d7-8c528c52ff86',0,3,19,N'Question number 17',N'<p>Đáp án là four weeks. Rác thải hiện tại được xử lý ít nhất mỗi bốn tuần một lần, dù thành phố đang cân nhắc tăng tần suất thu gom. Key words: once every: mỗi, four weeks: bốn tuần.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,17,NULL,0,1567),
(N'38a3e60e-c3ec-51c3-bf85-965d52921873',N'359fe400-d9fe-5d9e-b7d7-8c528c52ff86',0,3,19,N'Question number 18',N'<p>Đáp án là traffic. Thùng rác được dọn vào ban đêm nhằm tránh ùn tắc giao thông trong giờ cao điểm ban ngày. Key words: avoid: tránh, traffic: giao thông.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,18,NULL,0,1567),
(N'c305173b-cff1-5ae4-95f0-5182d9e08150',N'359fe400-d9fe-5d9e-b7d7-8c528c52ff86',0,3,19,N'Question number 19',N'<p>Đáp án là businesses. Người nói khẳng định nguồn tạo ra rác thải chính không phải hộ gia đình mà là các doanh nghiệp, cùng với công nghiệp, bán lẻ và văn phòng. Key words: main: chính, waste producers: nguồn tạo rác.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,19,NULL,0,1567),
(N'9c4f3247-9ea9-54b2-a140-367a7d4fb479',N'359fe400-d9fe-5d9e-b7d7-8c528c52ff86',0,3,19,N'Question number 20',N'<p>Đáp án là stones. Đá là ví dụ được nêu rõ về những vật không được phép bỏ vào bất kỳ thùng rác nào trong hệ thống thu gom. Key words: should not: không nên, stones: đá.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,20,NULL,0,1567),
(N'b300f78a-01cd-5b73-b15b-4b91c425b34a',N'a9ed6ee5-445b-5966-8c87-c84a1f7d802a',0,1,15,(CAST(N'<h2>[VOL 2] Test 4 - Section 3</h2><p>Hello, Dominic. Can I have a word?
Oh, hello, Grace. Of course you can.

You know, you applied for that extra training on the new computer software that we''re using.
Yes.
Well, I managed to push it through.

That''s great. I thought it would be rejected because it was too expensive.
There were certainly objections raised to that, but the main problem was that they didn''t want you away on the days of the training.

You''ll be away in San Francisco while we''re having the big sales meeting.
So what happened?
I said I''d be able to fill in for you if you told me the key things needed for the customers.
Thanks so much, Grace.

When can we meet so that you can fill me in then?
How about just before the normal start of work on Monday? We can arrive an hour early and I''ll have everything ready.
I drive my daughters to school on Mondays, so it''s hard for me to get here that early.
How about at the end of the working day on Friday?
I''m leaving here at lunchtime that day, as I have a meeting in town about the new parts we''re ordering.

The only time I''m really free is Thursday morning.
I''m in a meeting that time. Hmm.
Look, I''ll ask my friend Andrew to take my daughter into school on Monday.
That way we can meet as you first suggested.
Good. Thanks, Grace.

You''ll need to have your computer with you so that I can upload some stuff.
Will there be a lot to do?
Not really. I can explain all the rationale behind the design decisions to you, and if you make some brief notes, that''ll be enough.

I''ll also explain the model that we''ve made to show the customers.
It''ll be quite straightforward, as it''s similar to the last one we did for the previous contract.
The model is in my office.
Finally, I''ll also upload the sales forecast to you, as you''ll need that to prove that our ideas are right.
Good. That''s all clear.

Now, do you have any questions about the training? I''ve just read up about it for you.
Oh, good. Well, first of all, I''ll need to stay overnight in San Francisco.
How shall I pay for everything?
I paid in advance myself last time and then got the money back from the company.
That''s always a bit of a pain, though.
You have to collect and keep all the receipts safe.

I know the company card is not being used, so I''ll make sure you get that.
That''s good. I don''t like having to pay at these expensive hotels myself, as my credit card is nearly always maxed out.
The company is not keen on giving out cash in advance, either.
No, that''s' AS nvarchar(max))+N' not popular here.

The next thing is how the company would like me to travel to the training.
The bus is the cheapest, but I like to work on my computer, and that''s not very easy on a bus.
No, it isn''t. It''s also not really far enough for a plane journey, either.
Is there a train?
Yes. Amtrak has a service there.
What would you prefer?
Anything but the bus, really. I''d even drive rather than take the bus and miss the work on the journey.
I''ll make a train booking for you. Driving will be too tiring for you, and you want to arrive fresh and alert.
OK, thanks.

Now, I want to explain where your training is. It''s at the Green Bay Business Park.
You know where that is?
Yeah, I''ve been there before.
Do you know the Forward Thinking Training Centre as well?
No, I''ve never been to that training company before.
OK, so you arrive at the main gates. Go in and take the middle road. That will take you past the mobile phone company on the right and the GPS centre on the left.

Just a moment, Grace. I''ll just get some paper. I''ll need to write it down or I''ll forget.
No problem.
OK, here we are. I''m just making a note of what you just said. Right, carry on.

So after you pass the mobile phone company and the GPS centre, take the next right and then the first left.
Go 100 metres down that road and Forward Thinking will be on the left with the radio station opposite.
That seems fairly straightforward. You know, I think I do know this actually. I went there last year for an accountancy training.
That''s right. I went on that for a different account there as well.
Yes, it was a good training, so I know where it is now. When you pass Forward Thinking, then there''s a dead end with the recycling depot.
Yes, that''s right. You''ve got it.

