(N'82013d33-1b2a-523d-ade6-61b849259d35',N'60defc01-6663-5b25-a4fc-a56436dac796',0,3,19,N'<p>The speaker concludes by recommending visitors to</p>',N'<p>Đáp án B, vì hướng dẫn viên nhấn mạnh carry water.
