(N'2c78020f-8f30-578d-8ad3-2cd3e56c1ebf',N'348c809f-a49f-5048-be70-92ea858a209a',0,3,19,N'Question number 38',N'<p>Question: “According to Gardner, there is … between intelligences.” Answer: interaction. Key vocab: operate together = interaction.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,38,NULL,0,1540),
