(N'2cd88a20-75a9-5fd5-b91c-70b5c6153f64',N'473a3c84-fb96-5d38-9814-48993bc0dc92',0,3,19,N'<p><span>Research Project</span></p><p>Sports Science: Module 206</p><p>Research project: Effects of exercise on the human body</p><p><span>Application form must be given to:</span></p><ul><li><p>student’s</p></li></ul> }{SPACE}{ for signature</p><ul><li><p>subcommittee for</p></li></ul> }{SPACE}{ </p><p>Must hand in signed copy by: }{SPACE}{ </p><p><span>Filling in the application form</span></p><p><span>Title of project:</span> give in full</p><p><span>Investigations: </span>- give name(s)</p><p>                        - give details of their }{SPACE}{ and role in the project</p><p><span>Purpose of research:</span> help the subcommittee assess the }{SPACE}{ of the project</p><p><span>Experimental subjects:</span> - give number of people</p><p>                                    - state criteria for inclusion/exclusion e.g. age</p><p>                                     - describe method of recruitment e.g. }{SPACE}{ </p><p><span>Design of study: </span>general outline, including the }{SPACE}{ chosen for study</p><p><span>Procedures: </span>- include information on risks and discomforts</p><p>                    - see officer in charge of }{SPACE}{ (Chris Thorpe)</p><p><span>Finance:</span> give details of any }{SPACE}{ or sponsorship</p><p><span>Time scale:</span> give the project’s starting point and proposed }{SPACE}{ </p>',N'<p>Câu hỏi: “Application form must be given to student’s … for signature.” → Đáp án là tutor, vì chính tutor phải ký xác nhận trước khi gửi đi.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,31,NULL,0,1505),
(N'dbfc8f33-b315-53ad-98c8-a7a7af51d350',N'473a3c84-fb96-5d38-9814-48993bc0dc92',0,3,19,N'Question number 32',N'<p>Câu hỏi: “Application form must be given to subcommittee for …” → Đáp án là approval, vì tiểu ban phê duyệt đơn.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,32,NULL,0,1505),
(N'73db7ef8-8c7f-5915-b607-4eed97c1f9e9',N'473a3c84-fb96-5d38-9814-48993bc0dc92',0,3,19,N'Question number 33',N'<p>Câu hỏi: “Must hand in signed copy by …” → Đáp án là November 14th, chính ngày nộp hạn cuối.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,33,NULL,0,1505),
(N'7d4fa84d-e675-584e-9bbc-1a342da00418',N'473a3c84-fb96-5d38-9814-48993bc0dc92',0,3,19,N'Question number 34',N'<p>Câu hỏi: “Give details of their … and role in the project.” → Đáp án: qualifications, vì yêu cầu ghi bằng cấp/kinh nghiệm và vai trò.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,34,NULL,0,1505),
(N'0e3f9e7f-1a73-5136-a4d6-6363eb3bc1be',N'473a3c84-fb96-5d38-9814-48993bc0dc92',0,3,19,N'Question number 35',N'<p>Câu hỏi: “Help the subcommittee assess the … of the project.” → Đáp án: value, vì tiểu ban cần đánh giá giá trị/ý nghĩa của nghiên cứu.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,35,NULL,0,1505),
(N'2320eb98-7b9f-51d5-8bce-06553e1f170d',N'473a3c84-fb96-5d38-9814-48993bc0dc92',0,3,19,N'Question number 36',N'<p>Câu hỏi: “Describe method of recruitment e.g. …” → Đáp án: advertisements, vì ví dụ được đưa ra trong bài.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,36,NULL,0,1505),
(N'a3e55eac-46e1-5911-b003-7ee419e26341',N'473a3c84-fb96-5d38-9814-48993bc0dc92',0,3,19,N'Question number 37',N'<p>Câu hỏi: “General outline, including the … chosen for study.” → Đáp án: place, vì cần nêu địa điểm nghiên cứu.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,37,NULL,0,1505),
(N'1ed28771-0fc1-5aaf-afae-91c87685b538',N'473a3c84-fb96-5d38-9814-48993bc0dc92',0,3,19,N'Question number 38',N'<p>Câu hỏi: “See officer in charge of … (Chris Thorpe).” → Đáp án: safety, vì Chris Thorpe là safety officer.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,38,NULL,0,1505),
(N'fdd0b556-7306-5882-990a-14cdad04f8ff',N'473a3c84-fb96-5d38-9814-48993bc0dc92',0,3,19,N'Question number 39',N'<p>Câu hỏi: “Give details of any … or sponsorship.” → Đáp án: award, vì đây là hỗ trợ tài chính ngoài.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,39,NULL,0,1505),
(N'60013b35-67a9-5b27-88c9-1a978653ad64',N'473a3c84-fb96-5d38-9814-48993bc0dc92',0,3,19,N'Question number 40',N'<p>Câu hỏi: “Give the project’s starting point and proposed …” → Đáp án: duration, vì cần ghi thời gian dự kiến kéo dài bao lâu.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,40,NULL,0,1505),
(N'03c3bf9b-8545-5de7-b42f-5ba532c9409d',NULL,0,0,11,NULL,NULL,NULL,N'https://ieltsroom.com/upload/audio/iL-full-test/ieltsadvancedtest/vol-4/iL.VOL4.2.S1504.mp3',N'Vol 4 LISTENING FULL TEST 2',0,7,1,NULL,1,1504),
(N'44bf0a98-a680-564c-b4ed-c4db582a6681',N'03c3bf9b-8545-5de7-b42f-5ba532c9409d',0,1,13,(CAST(N'<h2>[VOL 4] International Student Travel Agency Enquiry Form</h2><p>(1-6) Hello, how can I help you? I''m taking a year off and I''m hoping to travel abroad and to find work as well for part of the time. I know you specialise in student travel and work placements, so that''s right. We can help you arrange your travel and set up a job for you. First of all, I need some personal details, and then we''ll match your details against our database to see what''s available worklife. Great! OK, your full name? Sarah Brown. Date of birth? March 30th? Oh, I''m the 31st, 1988. And your address? 21 Waverley Road, Radstone, RD46WV. And a contact telephone number, please? I can give you my mobile number: 0903. 775 115 Fine. Now tell me where you plan to travel to, and I''ll see how I can help. 00:02:37 Well, I''d like to go to Northern Europe. Have you been there before? No, I know Southern Europe quite well, as I''ve been there with my family. We always went by plane, but now I can choose? I''d like to go by train so I can stop off whenever I want. OK. Now, just as important, what sort of work have you got in mind? Well, I thought about hotel work because then I might get accommodation with the job. And I''d like to work for about half the year. Hmm. That sort of work is usually quite competitive. Perhaps you should consider an alternative just in case. Such as? Well, lots of students. like to work on a farm. And we have lots of requests from people looking for student workers for a few weeks at a time throughout the year. You can generally earn quite good money if you''re willing to work fairly long hours. (7-10) Now travel. Buying single tickets would be expensive, so the best option would be to have a European pass, which would give you unlimited rail travel at off-peak times. To start off with, we could issue one for up to three months to cover the countries you''re intending to visit. Sounds good. Do you have any information about youth hostels which I could use to plan my route? Yes, I''ll give you a booklet now. But it''s down to you to book your accommodation. At certain times of the year, especially during public holiday periods, such places fill up fast. And remember, if we''re going to arrange work for you in the countryside, you won''t be able to go out easily in the evenings. 00:04:51 Although you''d probably be too tired anyway, I won''t mind that. And you''re going to be travelling alone? Yes. Well, before I make any arrangements for you, you need to have insurance for your ' AS nvarchar(max))+N'entire trip. We can arrange that for you if you like. What does it cover? Any valuable items – jewellery, for example, your money, your mobile, your health. And if you needed to get back home quickly, you''d be covered, so you could buy a plane ticket. Right, I''ll do that. I thought I''d take my laptop so I can email and keep in touch with people at home. Not a good idea to lug your computer around with you. It''s much more sensible to rely on an internet cafe. That''s what we tell people to do. Oh, OK. Right, so I''ve entered all your details. Let''s see what the database comes up with.</p>'),(CAST(N'<p>(1-6) Hello, how can I help you? I''m taking a year off and I''m hoping to travel abroad and to find work as well for part of the time. I know you specialise in student travel and work placements, so that''s right. We can help you arrange your travel and set up a job for you. First of all, I need some personal details, and then we''ll match your details against our database to see what''s available worklife. Great! OK, your full name? Sarah Brown. Date of birth? March 30th? Oh, I''m the 31st, 1988. And your address? 21 Waverley Road, Radstone, RD46WV. And a contact telephone number, please? I can give you my mobile number: 0903. 775 115 Fine. Now tell me where you plan to travel to, and I''ll see how I can help. 00:02:37 Well, I''d like to