 the importance. Of maintaining open- mindedness when deciding on strategies for expansion, sometimes it''s necessary to employ an independent consultant who can offer an objective and unbiased view on the running of your company. Emotion will only ever cloud your ability to make business-related decisions. Research suitable case studies and look at how department stores, for example, were able to alter their organisational structure while minimising costs and staff redundancies. Precedents are an essential resource when it comes to making decisions for your own business, so don''t undervalue them. Well, that wraps up our lecture. for today. If there are any questions</p>'),NULL,N'https://ieltsroom.com/upload/audio/iL-full-test/ieltsadvancedtest/vol-4/iL.VOL4.2.S1504.PART4.mp3',NULL,1,0,4,NULL,0,1504),
