(N'd4c808ec-3726-5c7b-ac63-5ccf535a2a3f',N'bb1749d6-ed45-5e38-96d6-c80b6f0926c2',0,3,19,N'Question number 2',N'<p>- Đáp án là 30th</p><p>- Ngày sinh được nêu rõ là “30th of May 1988”, câu hỏi chỉ yêu cầu điền ngày trong tháng</p><p>- Key word:+ date of birth: (noun) ngày sinh+ of May: (preposition phrase) thuộc tháng Năm</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,2,NULL,0,1503),
(N'567d6509-09e4-51aa-b22d-d53f5b2e163f',N'bb1749d6-ed45-5e38-96d6-c80b6f0926c2',0,3,19,N'Question number 3',N'<p>- Đáp án là Australia</p><p>- Địa chỉ email chứa tên miền AustraliaNow.com, trong đó phần cần điền là “Australia” theo đúng định dạng đề bài</p><p>- Key word:+ email address: (noun) địa chỉ email+ provider: (noun) nhà cung cấp</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,3,NULL,0,1503),
(N'9e3686b6-81d4-5202-913c-fee1d892ed0f',N'bb1749d6-ed45-5e38-96d6-c80b6f0926c2',0,3,19,N'Question number 4',N'<p>- Đáp án là 443</p><p>- Số điện thoại di động được đọc đầy đủ, chỗ trống yêu cầu ba chữ số cuối của số mobile</p><p>- Key word:+ mobile number: (noun) số điện thoại di động+ number: (noun) con số</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,4,NULL,0,1503),
(N'04a8c0a7-b843-5c8f-a264-a679830ba9c5',N'bb1749d6-ed45-5e38-96d6-c80b6f0926c2',0,3,19,N'Question number 5',N'<p>- Đáp án là 2 hours</p><p>- Mark nêu rõ phạm vi đi làm mong muốn là trong vòng “a drive of about two hours” từ nhà</p><p>- Key word:+ drive: (noun) quãng đường lái xe+ hours: (noun) giờ</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,5,NULL,0,1503),
(N'dce09c32-0ae7-57fd-a012-8a7ea4f972fc',N'cb3153a9-c345-5847-9bba-4f6febe7c99a',0,2,18,N'<p>Complete the sentences below.</p><p>Use <span>NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS </span>from the listening for each answer.</p>',N'',N'',N'',N'',11,0,2,NULL,0,1503),
(N'1e1d017b-04c1-528b-a1dc-c59d2be1ae0c',N'dce09c32-0ae7-57fd-a012-8a7ea4f972fc',0,3,19,N'<p>Mark will send }{SPACE}{ of his professional certificates to Sarah.</p><p>Mark could happily travel to Gold Coast Printing by }{SPACE}{ as well as by car.</p><p>The }{SPACE}{ nature of the job at the import export company is a problem for Mark.</p><p>Mark is worried about }{SPACE}{ at a smaller company like the fishing company, Barracuda.</p><p>Mark will not need to pay a }{SPACE}{ for any job placement.</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là scans</p><p>- Mark cho biết anh có bản scan của các chứng chỉ chuyên môn và sẽ gửi cho Sarah thay vì bản gốc</p><p>- Key word:+ scans: (noun) bản quét+ certificates: (noun) chứng chỉ </p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,6,NULL,0,1503),
(N'a7faa2be-e773-5bae-a5ba-13ccdff050a2',N'dce09c32-0ae7-57fd-a012-8a7ea4f972fc',0,3,19,N'Question number 7',N'<p>- Đáp án là train</p><p>- Mark nói rõ anh có thể đi đến Gold Coast Printing bằng tàu hỏa ngoài việc đi bằng ô tô</p><p>- Key word:+ train: (noun) tàu hỏa+ travel: (verb) di chuyển</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,7,NULL,0,1503),
(N'd0624129-680a-5b24-ab2b-30ddf924285c',N'dce09c32-0ae7-57fd-a012-8a7ea4f972fc',0,3,19,N'Question number 8',N'<p>- Đáp án là part-time</p><p>- Mark cho rằng tính chất bán thời gian của công việc ở công ty xuất nhập khẩu là một vấn đề đối với anh</p><p>- Key word:+ part-time: (adjective) bán thời gian+ job: (noun) công việc</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,8,NULL,0,1503),
(N'd8116dec-a78c-55d6-a465-ee06dccd0019',N'dce09c32-0ae7-57fd-a012-8a7ea4f972fc',0,3,19,N'Question number 9',N'<p>- Đáp án là relationships</p><p>- Mark bày tỏ lo ngại về các mối quan hệ cá nhân khi làm việc tại công ty nhỏ như Barracuda</p><p>- Key word:+ personal relationships: (noun phrase) mối quan hệ cá nhân+ small company: (noun phrase) công ty nhỏ</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,9,NULL,0,1503),
(N'990ec7be-eac3-5613-9942-9357dc9e6fbb',N'dce09c32-0ae7-57fd-a012-8a7ea4f972fc',0,3,19,N'Question number 10',N'<p>- Đáp án là commission</p><p>- Sarah xác nhận Mark không phải trả bất kỳ khoản hoa hồng nào cho việc giới thiệu công việc</p><p>- Key word:+ commission: (noun) hoa hồng+ charged: (verb) bị tính phí</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,10,NULL,0,1503),
(N'68f8534f-0add-53ca-8888-894d90c17a13',N'f24f244d-5fb2-522a-aa5f-64c5876eb899',0,1,14,(CAST(N'<h2>[VOL 1] Sway Road Health Centre</h2><p>Welcome everyone today to the Sway Road Health Centre''s open morning.</p><p>My name is Lucy and I''m a nurse based at the health centre.</p><p>I''d first like to tell you a little about the health centre. We have six doctors who work here full time and we are part of the district''s medical centre. We have six doctors who work here full time and we are part of the district''s medical centre. And we are part of the district''s medical services to those who live within our practice area.</p><p>Currently we have just in excess of 7,000 patients registered here.</p><p>The patients are served from our centre here in Sway Road, but we also have a secondary centre in church road to ease congestion here and to make it easier for patients who live in that part of town.</p><p>To register with us, please come during opening hours, bringing a photo ID, a proof of residence at the centre, and a address dated within three months of your application and your medical card if you have one. If you don''t, we''ll ask you to fill out a registration form.</p><p>We will ask for your preference for your doctor and we will try to comply, although this is not always possible.</p><p>When applying, the reception staff will ask you for your medical history and they will also ask a nurse to take a blood sample. It''s unusual that we would turn anyone down and you can see a doctor as soon as you''ve registered.</p><p>Your updated medical card will be posted to you as soon as possible.</p><p>If you want to make an appointment with us, this should be made by telephone and not by email. We have email, but due to the large amount we received, some do not get read fast enough and appointments are not made in time.</p><p>Calls can be made to our centre during our opening hours, which are 8am to 1pm and 2pm to 7pm, Monday to Friday.</p><p>Between 1pm and 2pm, the centre is closed, except for emergency calls only.</p><p>We are closed on Saturdays, Sundays and on public holidays.</p><p>If you do have an emergency, we would stress that a serious one would be better served by going to hospital or by calling an ambulance.</p><p>Practice supports the training of medical students and you might be asked whether your visit to a nurse or doctor can be done with a student present. There is no obligation for you to accept this and the student will not be present if you prefer to have your consultation in private.</p><p>Our surgery offers a complete travel service, includ' AS nvarchar(max))+N'ing a full range of vaccinations. The wide diversity of destinations and the increased popularity of adventure holidays increase the risk to your health, which in turn makes the service we provide increasingly complex.</p><p>Ask for a travel risk format reception, or a download it from our website and hand it in to our reception as soon as you''ve booked your holiday.</p><p>Our nurse will review the form and advise you on the vaccinations you should have.</p><p>It''s also a good idea to keep a vaccination card, so you have a record of what you have had over the years.</p><p>Vaccinations must be paid for on the day of administration, unless you are covered by a health insurer.</p><p>Finally, if you have any suggestions to improve our service, please use the suggestion box at reception. We will provide you with paper and pen if you don''t have any.</p><p>So from time to time, people feel that they have a problem with their care. If you have any complaints about the service you receive at our health center, please bring this to the attention of the practice manager who will be happy to discuss the issue.</p><p>We have a complaints procedure that is available at reception or it can be downloaded from our website.</p><p>So today all our staff are here for this Saturday morning so that you can look around the center and ask any questions. This includes all our doctors, nurses and support staff.</p><p>All the areas are open except for the practice offices which have some sensitive material.</p><p>You can wander around and ask anyone questions, though please remember that the doctors are not here for consultations. So please do not turn any conversations into a doctor''s visit.</p><p>That''s enough for me. Please now look around and ask whatever questions you want.</p><p>If you have any questions for today, then just go to reception and they''ll get you organised.</p><p>I''ll be based here in the waiting room so you can ask me any questions as well of course.</p>'),(CAST(N'<p>Welcome everyone today to the Sway Road Health Centre''s open morning.</p><p>My name is Lucy and I''m a nurse based at the health centre.</p><p>I''d first like to tell you a little about the health centre. We have six doctors who work here full time and we are part of the district''s medical centre. We have six doctors who work here full time and we are part of the district''s medical centre. And we are part of the district''s medical services to those who live within our practice area.</p><p>Currently we have just in excess of 7,000 patients registered here.</p><p>The patients are served from our centre here in Sway Road, but we also have a secondary centre in church road to ease congestion here and to make it easier for patients who live in that part of town.</p><p>To register with us, please come during opening hours, bringing a photo ID, a proof of residence at the centre, and a address dated within three months of your application and your medical card if you have one. If you don''t, we''ll ask you to fill out a registration form.</p><p>We will ask for your preference for your doctor and we will try to comply, although this is not always possible.</p><p>When applying, the reception staff will ask you for your medical history and they will also ask a nurse to take a blood sample. It''s unusual that we would turn anyone down and you can see a doctor as soon as you''ve registered.</p><p>Your updated medical card will be posted to you as soon as possible.</p><p>If you want to make an appointment with us, this should be made by telephone and not by email. We have email, but due to the large amount we received, some do not get read fast enough and appointments are not made in time.</p><p>Calls can be made to our centre during our opening hours, which are 8am to 1pm and 2pm to 7pm, Monday to Friday.</p><p>Between 1pm and 2pm, the centre is closed, except for emergency calls only.</p><p>We are closed on Saturdays, Sundays and on public holidays.</p><p>If you do have an emergency, we would stress that a serious one would be better served by going to hospital or by calling an ambulance.</p><p>Practice supports the training of medical students and you might be asked whether your visit to a nurse or doctor can be done with a student present. There is no obligation for you to accept this and the student will not be present if you prefer to have your consultation in private.</p><p>Our surgery offers a complete travel service, including a full range of vaccinations. The wi' AS nvarchar(max))+N'de diversity of destinations and the increased popularity of adventure holidays increase the risk to your health, which in turn makes the service we provide increasingly complex.</p><p>Ask for a travel risk format reception, or a download it from our website and hand it in to our reception as soon as you''ve booked your holiday.</p><p>Our nurse will review the form and advise you on the vaccinations you should have.</p><p>It''s also a good idea to keep a vaccination card, so you have a record of what you have had over the years.</p><p>Vaccinations must be paid for on the day of administration, unless you are covered by a health insurer.</p><p>Finally, if you have any suggestions to improve our service, please use the suggestion box at reception. We will provide you with paper and pen if you don''t have any.</p><p>So from time to time, people feel that they have a problem with their care. If you have any complaints about the service you receive at our health center, please bring this to the attention of the practice manager who will be happy to discuss the issue.</p><p>We have a complaints procedure that is available at reception or it can be downloaded from our website.</p><p>So today all our staff are here for this Saturday morning so that you can look around the center and ask any questions. This includes all our doctors, nurses and support staff.</p><p>All the areas are open except for the practice offices which have some sensitive material.</p><p>You can wander around and ask anyone questions, though please remember that the doctors are not here for consultations. So please do not turn any conversations into a doctor''s visit.</p><p>That''s enough for me. Please now look around and ask whatever questions you want.</p><p>If you have any questions for today, then just go to reception and they''ll get you organised.</p><p>I''ll be based here in the waiting room so you can ask me any questions as well of course.</p>'),NULL,N'https://ieltsroom.com/upload/audio/iL-full-test/ieltsadvancedtest/vol-1/iL.VOL1.10.S1503.PART2.mp3',NULL,1,0,2,NULL,0,1503),
(N'18f7a98a-e6f4-57a1-9f0d-cb9764499b78',N'68f8534f-0add-53ca-8888-894d90c17a13',0,2,18,N'<p>Complete the notes below on the Sway Road Health Centre.</p><p>Write <span>NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER</span> from the listening for each answer.</p>',N'',N'',N'',N'Sway Road Health Centre',11,0,1,NULL,0,1503),
(N'7e60fb9f-d0d5-516e-ba3e-a53ee7090178',N'18f7a98a-e6f4-57a1-9f0d-cb9764499b78',0,3,19,N'<h3>Sway Road Health Centre</h3><p>Six full-time doctors</p><p>Just over }{SPACE}{ patients</p><p>2 centres - Sway Road and Church Road</p><p><u>Registering</u> - come during opening hours; bring a }{SPACE}{ proof of address (dated within 3 months of application) and medical card (or fill out a registration from).</p><p>Staff will ask for your medical history and organise a }{SPACE}{ to be taken.
</p><p><u>Appointments</u> - contact only by phone and not by  }{SPACE}{ . Call only during opening hours </p><p><u>Opening Hours</u></p><p> }{SPACE}{ am. - 1 pm. and 2 p.m. - 7 p.m. Monday to Friday</p><p>(call only between 1 p.m. &amp; 2 p.m. in an emergency)
</p><p>(closed weekends and }{SPACE}{ )
</p><p>The best option for emergencies is to go to hospital or call an ambulance.</p><p><u>Media Students </u>- consultations with doctors or nurses may have a student present; there is
no cbligatlon to have a student present.</p><p><u>Travel Service</u> - lots of vaccinations available. Complete a }{SPACE}{ at reception - available from reception or the website. The nurse will make vaccination recommendations. </p><p>Get a vaccination card. Vaccinations to be paid for on the day of vaccination.</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là 7000</p><p>- Script nêu rõ số lượng bệnh nhân đăng ký là “just in excess of 7,000”, phù hợp trực tiếp với chỗ trống hỏi số bệnh nhân</p><p>- Key word:+ patients: (noun) bệnh nhân+ registered: (adjective) đã đăng ký</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,11,NULL,0,1503),
(N'1339dac6-1162-50f8-8a4d-1c71ea969c06',N'18f7a98a-e6f4-57a1-9f0d-cb9764499b78',0,3,19,N'Question number 12',N'<p>- Đáp án là photo ID</p><p>- Khi đăng ký, người bệnh được yêu cầu mang theo “a photo ID”, đây là giấy tờ tùy thân bắt buộc theo script</p><p>- Key word:+ register: (verb) đăng ký+ ID: (noun) giấy tờ tùy thân</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,12,NULL,0,1503),
(N'aebaa217-b0ec-556d-bbef-c0ebc9b50393',N'18f7a98a-e6f4-57a1-9f0d-cb9764499b78',0,3,19,N'Question number 13',N'<p>- Đáp án là blood sample</p><p>- Script nói rõ y tá sẽ được yêu cầu “to take a blood sample”, đúng với nội dung cần điền</p><p>- Key word:+ nurse: (noun) y tá+ blood sample: (noun) mẫu máu</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,13,NULL,0,1503),
(N'c9ef78ac-6fff-55a2-8085-f91fcb632cd0',N'18f7a98a-e6f4-57a1-9f0d-cb9764499b78',0,3,19,N'Question number 14',N'<p>- Đáp án là email</p><p>- Đặt lịch hẹn chỉ được thực hiện qua điện thoại, không phải bằng email, được nêu trực tiếp trong bài nghe</p><p>- Key word:+ appointment: (noun) lịch hẹn+ telephone: (noun) điện thoại</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,14,NULL,0,1503),
(N'7f12fb5a-002c-55bc-a5e5-767a50279c4a',N'18f7a98a-e6f4-57a1-9f0d-cb9764499b78',0,3,19,N'Question number 15',N'<p>- Đáp án là 8</p><p>- Giờ mở cửa buổi sáng bắt đầu từ “8am”, nên số cần điền là 8</p><p>- Key word:+ opening hours: (noun) giờ mở cửa+ am: (adverb) buổi sáng</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,15,NULL,0,1503),
