(N'f499c421-4e1e-58b1-91ee-df311eda52f5',N'32ff2807-089e-5744-ba2d-d7d55dfc6c44',0,3,19,N'<h3>Accommodation request</h3><table border="1"><tbody><tr><td><p>Type of accommodation: </p></td><td><p>a house</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Preferred location:</p></td><td><p>the }{SPACE}{ of the town</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Facilities required:</p></td><td><p>furnished property - with a }{SPACE}{ </p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Period of time required: </p></td><td><p>one year</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Start date of rental period:</p></td><td> }{SPACE}{ </td></tr><tr><td><p>Present address:</p></td><td><p>56, Stone street</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Phone number:</p></td><td><p>(mobile) 07942326584</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Reference from:</p></td><td><p>her }{SPACE}{ </p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Maximum rent:</p></td><td><p>£ }{SPACE}{ per month</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Applicant''s job:</p></td><td> }{SPACE}{ </td></tr><tr><td><p><span>Documents to be supplied</span></p></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><p>ID check:</p></td><td><p>applicant''s passport</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Credit check:</p></td><td><p>a }{SPACE}{ </p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>Viewing arrangements</span></p></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><p>Address of property:</p></td><td><p>33, }{SPACE}{ Street</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Viewing day and time:</p></td><td><p>Saturday 4 p.m</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>To check:</p></td><td><p>Is there a }{SPACE}{ in the house? </p></td></tr><tr><td></td><td><p>Is there a }{SPACE}{ nearby?</p></td></tr></tbody></table>',N'<p>- Đáp án là south-east. 
- Người môi giới gợi ý khu south-east và người thuê đồng ý ngay. 
- Đây là vị trí mong muốn “the ___ of the town”. 
- Key word: 
+ south-east (noun): phía đông nam 
+ location (noun): vị trí
</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,0,1473),
(N'80ba2a9f-3598-537a-90d2-9e65954de5b1',N'32ff2807-089e-5744-ba2d-d7d55dfc6c44',0,3,19,N'Question number 2',N'<p>- Đáp án là washing machine. 
