(N'4556ce25-73a3-5398-85d6-c640cdbb89f3',N'98e4dcec-6e59-544b-96c8-e1c78b91a93a',0,3,19,N'<p>When people feed city pigeons, it causes them to</p>',N'<p> Đáp án là A. 
