(N'df9609dc-8167-5103-8977-8a85fe44ff09',N'98e4dcec-6e59-544b-96c8-e1c78b91a93a',0,3,19,N'<p>Adam and Jennifer decide to do some more research on how pigeons can</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là A. 
