(N'6124b6a1-727a-5e10-89a1-02cf3f8f1e57',N'7cc44ef7-90fa-5f73-b0a2-0beba24ad18d',0,3,19,N'<p><span>Archaeology Course</span></p><p>Can be combined with any other subject except }{SPACE}{ </p><p>Has three }{SPACE}{ modules in first semester?</p><p><span>Module 1</span></p><p>Title:  }{SPACE}{ </p><p>Lecturer: Dr. Morris</p><p>Learning method: Lectures and practical sessions</p><p>Content: Based on processes recording</p><p>interpretation display }{SPACE}{ </p><p>Assessment: By  }{SPACE}{ </p><p><span>Module 2</span></p><p>Title: }{SPACE}{ </p><p>Lecturer: Prof.Elliot</p><p>Content: }{SPACE}{ and development of built environments</p><p>Assessment: By }{SPACE}{ examination</p><p><span>Module 3</span></p><p>Title: Method and Science</p><p>Lecturer: Dr. Thompson</p><p>Content: Standard techniques in fieldwork and analysis</p><p>Learning method: 50% lab work, 50%  }{SPACE}{ </p><p>Site survey at end of module (the  }{SPACE}{ is to be announced later)</p>',N'<p>Đáp án là classical history. </p><p>- Tutor nói rõ khảo cổ học có thể kết hợp với mọi môn trừ classical history do trùng lịch học. </p><p>- Key word: </p><p>+ combine (v) kết hợp </p><p>+ overlap (n/v) trùng</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,21,NULL,0,1445),
