</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,15,NULL,0,1439),
(N'ef2945c3-02ae-501a-a4db-c15cc80d3b9a',N'77494ca7-4e2f-5854-9d56-e102adf977bb',0,3,19,N'Question number 16',N'<p>- Đáp án là Art Gallery. 
