</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,16,NULL,0,1439),
(N'66060ee8-adfb-5c5b-82dc-5849a4710c6f',N'77494ca7-4e2f-5854-9d56-e102adf977bb',0,3,19,N'Question number 17',N'<p>- Đáp án là Concert Hall. 
