(N'9025811b-fe94-5b2d-b7c6-d74c0f137643',N'34ad76a5-f386-5197-9798-1e617b4a17e1',0,1,13,(CAST(N'<h2>Customer complaint form: product return</h2><p>Morning, madam. Can I help you? Yes, hello. I have a complaint to make about this vacuum cleaner. I''m wanting to return it. Oh dear, I''m sorry to hear that. Well, could I take down your details first? Your name, please? It''s Diane Ruddick. That''s R U double D I C K. Fine, thanks. And your address? It''s 34 Garden Avenue. I haven''t heard of that one. That''s here in Hamilton, is it? Yes. It''s just a small street. Right. And what number can I reach you on? That would be 970-7520. And that''s home because my mobile is not working at the moment. And, at the office, I share a phone line, so it''s better not to call me at work.  OK then. And now a few details about the product itself. When did you buy it? Do you remember? Yes, it says on the—hang on, I need my glasses to read it. </p><p>Does that say the 21st of July? Oh no, sorry, it''s the 31st. Mm hm. And I see you''ve got the vacuum with you. It looks like a Volta budget model. What''s the size of the motor on that one? It says 2000 watts. OK. And I can see that it''s a nice bright red, so I''ll just write that down. Yes, I like the colour. And I got it for an excellent price too – only $104 on sale, which was good considering that I''d nearly bought one for $130 in another shop. OK, well, that all sounds very good, so what seems to be the matter with it? Does it not clean your floor properly? No, it does, but it''s definitely faulty because there''s a problem with the handle. Do you see? It''s permanently stuck in this upright position. It won''t fold back down into place as it should. OK, well, that''s annoying for you. There are a couple of possible solutions. </p><p>One thing we could do is, I could keep it here for now and offer you a repair at no charge. No thanks, I think I''d like to exchange it for a better model. Right. You''ll have to stick with the Volta b