(N'aa0790f3-a584-5461-b5e4-0490bd0535fc',N'9290e829-1255-5340-aed6-9587ffb1c9c9',0,3,19,N'<h3>Customer complaint form: product return</h3><p><span>Type of product:</span> vacuum cleaner</p><p><span>Customer details</span></p><p>• Name: Diane }{SPACE}{ </p><p>• Street address: 34.  }{SPACE}{ </p><p>• City: Hamilton</p><p>• Telephone: 970 7520 (her 3 }{SPACE}{ number)</p><p><span>Product details</span></p><p>• Date of purchase: on }{SPACE}{ </p><p>• Make and model: Volta Budget</p><p>• Power: 2000 watts</p><p>• Color: red</p><p>• Purchase price: $5 }{SPACE}{ (in the sale)</p><p><span>Fault details</span></p><p>• Problem with: the }{SPACE}{ </p><p>• First solution: free }{SPACE}{ (not accepted by customer)</p><p>• Action requested: exchange</p><p><span>Customer requirements</span></p><p>• Special features needed: a reusable 8 }{SPACE}{ </p><p>• Price quoted: $ }{SPACE}{ </p><p>• Preferred colour: }{SPACE}{ </p>',N'<p>Cần lưu ý khi nghe người nói đọc từng chữ cái, đôi khi người nói có thể nói nhầm và nói lại.
