(N'b63bf087-958e-5c61-9f20-6e8cea65909e',NULL,0,0,11,NULL,NULL,NULL,N'https://ieltsroom.com/upload/audio/iL-full-test/ieltsadvancedtest/vol-4/iL.VOL4.5.S1025.mp3',N'Vol 4 LISTENING FULL TEST 5',0,7,1,NULL,1,1025),
(N'453106e0-1695-5b31-8e7e-73d9b5545596',N'b63bf087-958e-5c61-9f20-6e8cea65909e',0,1,13,(CAST(N'<h2>[VOL 4] Summerton - Activity Centre</h2><p>Morning. You''ve reached Somerton Child Care Centre. This is Sarah speaking. How can I assist you today? Hi Sarah, I''m planning to visit your centre with my children next weekend, and I''d like to get some information about your facilities and activities. Course, I''d be happy to help. First, let me give you our location. We''re on North Hill, right opposite the supermarket. Oh wait, sorry about that. That''s our old location. We''re now opposite the toy factory, just down the road. Got it. Is parking available there? Absolutely There''s plenty of parking available both in front of the centre and in the overflow lot around the corner. You''ll find it much easier than the old location which had limited space. That''s a relief. What about entry fees? Entry is actually free for everyone, and to make it even better, adults receive a complimentary drink. Some people think it''s only coffee, but we offer tea, water, and even juice as options. That''s generous. Are there any new features or attractions at your centre? Oh yes, we''ve added a lot recently. There''s a large slide which we call the Wildcat. It''s quite popular. It''s bigger and steeper than our older slides so it''s a real hit. Then we''ve introduced a mini golf area for children, complete with five themed courses. Wow, that sounds amazing! Are there any other play areas? Well, we still have the Jungle Gym and the Arts and Crafts Corner, but those aren''t new, there is also a sand pit, but it''s currently under renovation. </p><p>The slide and the golf courses are the main attractions we''re highlighting this year. Are there any special requirements for kids who want to participate? Yes, there are a few; First all children must wear trousers. This is mainly for safety during activities like sliding or climbing. Shorts just aren''t suitable. Okay, that''s good. to know. Oh, and every child must also wear socks. This is particularly important for the indoor play zones, as we don''t allow barefoot play for hygiene reasons. Got it. Anything else we need to prepare? Yes, you''ll need to bring a label with each child''s name on it. We can provide labels at the center if you forget, but it''s easier if you come prepared. Sure, I can manage that. By the way, I''m also thinking of organizing a birthday party for my son. Do you have any packages for that? Absolutely! Our birthday party packages are very popular. To book a party, you''ll need at least eight children. That''s the minimum number' AS nvarchar(max))+N' of participants. And what''s included in the package? The Basic package includes food, drinks, and decorations. You can also add optional extras like a cake or entertainment, say a magician, or a clown for an additional fee. That sounds nice. Do you cater for dietary restrictions? Yes, we do. We have vegetarian and gluten-free options, and we can customize the menu further if needed. Just let us know in advance so we can make the necessary arrangements. Perfect! Are there any discounts if we book early? Actually, yes. If you book at least two weeks in advance, you''ll get a 10% discount on the total package price. That applies to all parties booked for weekend. That''s fantastic! Thanks so much for the detailed information. You''re welcome. Feel free to call back if you have any more questions, or you can visit our website for more details. Will do. Thanks again.</p>'),(CAST(N'<p>Morning. You''ve reached Somerton Child Care Centre. This is Sarah speaking. How can I assist you today? Hi Sarah, I''m planning to visit your centre with my children next weekend, and I''d like to get some information about your facilities and activities. Course, I''d be happy to help. First, let me give you our location. We''re on North Hill, right opposite the supermarket. Oh wait, sorry about that. That''s our old location. We''re now opposite the to