hat''s the minimum number of participants. And what''s included in the' AS nvarchar(max))+N' package? The Basic package includes food, drinks, and decorations. You can also add optional extras like a cake or entertainment, say a magician, or a clown for an additional fee. That sounds nice. Do you cater for dietary restrictions? Yes, we do. We have vegetarian and gluten-free options, and we can customize the menu further if needed. Just let us know in advance so we can make the necessary arrangements. Perfect! Are there any discounts if we book early? Actually, yes. If you book at least two weeks in advance, you''ll get a 10% discount on the total package price. That applies to all parties booked for weekend. That''s fantastic! Thanks so much for the detailed information. You''re welcome. Feel free to call back if you have any more questions, or you can visit our website for more details. Will do. Thanks again.</p>'),NULL,N'https://ieltsroom.com/upload/audio/iL-full-test/ieltsadvancedtest/vol-4/iL.VOL4.5.S1025.PART1.mp3',NULL,1,0,1,NULL,0,1025),
(N'222b3c78-11fc-5326-a9c4-d7763d91beb3',N'453106e0-1695-5b31-8e7e-73d9b5545596',0,2,18,N'<p>Complete the note below.
