(N'f2bc6e14-b79c-5bc3-ac74-3b164a131da7',N'a6f9698e-971d-521c-a35b-d32cab6ad6ab',0,3,19,N'<p>Closure</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là F (Distrust of the
