(N'f94ea7b3-21fa-5977-bad8-2a86290b9de3',N'936dcdff-47ab-56be-b54e-b4161e49c8e6',0,3,19,N'<h3>Campsite Reservation Form</h3><table border="1"><tbody><tr><td><p><span>Name: </span>    Sandra Kemp</p> <p><span>Park region:</span> }{SPACE}{ California</p> <p><span>Campground name:</span> }{SPACE}{ Campground</p> <p><span>Type of site:</span> }{SPACE}{ </p> <p><span>Type of vehicle:     </span>will be driving a }{SPACE}{ </p> <p><span>Licence plate number:</span> }{SPACE}{ </p> <p><span>Number of nights:     </span>two</p> <p><span>Departure date:</span> }{SPACE}{ </p> <p><span>Bear-proof food container:</span>     size required: }{SPACE}{ </p> <p><span>Type of nature walk booked</span>:     the }{SPACE}{ walk</p> <p><span>Type of park pass:</span>     the }{SPACE}{ Pass</p> <p><span>Donation programme selection:</span>     the }{SPACE}{ programme</p></td></tr></tbody></table>',N'<p>- Đáp án là Southern. Nhân viên hỏi trực tiếp Mount Laguna thuộc Central hay Southern để xác định park region. </p><p>- Người phụ nữ xác nhận địa điểm mình đi, và nhân viên kết luận rõ ràng “That''s Southern.” Vì trong đề đã có sẵn “California”, nên chỉ cần điền tên vùng. </p><p>- Key words: region, Mount Laguna, Southern</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,0,1017),
(N'435fa75c-8746-5bff-b9ec-b2c9055be92e',N'936dcdff-47ab-56be-b54e-b4161e49c8e6',0,3,19,N'Question number 2',N'<p>- Đáp án là Mountain. Người phụ nữ phân vân giữa Sunrise và Mountain Campground. </p><p>- Nhân viên giải thích Sunrise không phù hợp vì chỉ cho phép câu cá từ tháng 6 đến tháng 9, trong khi chuyến đi diễn ra vào tháng 4. Vì vậy, Mountain được đề xuất và được chấp nhận. </p><p>- Key words: campground, Sunrise, Mountain</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,2,NULL,0,1017),
(N'e371f6d3-88e4-5e76-8e1d-23f5d72b6cee',N'936dcdff-47ab-56be-b54e-b4161e49c8e6',0,3,19,N'Question number 3',N'<p>- Đáp án là tent.
- Nhân viên liệt kê các loại site có
thể chọn. Khi được hỏi loại nào yên
tĩnh nhất, nhân viên trả lời trực tiếp
“A tent site”. Đề chỉ yêu cầu loại
site nên không cần thêm từ “site”.
- Key words: type of site, peace and
quiet, tent</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,3,NULL,0,1017),
(N'4a608e04-6ad8-58c1-ad74-3bf47db566a6',N'936dcdff-47ab-56be-b54e-b4161e49c8e6',0,3,19,N'Question number 4',N'<p>- Đáp án là truck. </p><p>- Nhân viên cảnh báo xe hơi dễ bị kẹt khi mưa. Người phụ nữ xác nhận họ có truck và sẽ lái xe đó thay vì car. Thông tin này khớp trực tiếp với “type of vehicle”. </p><p>- Key words: vehicle, truck, driving</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,4,NULL,0,1017),
(N'99e4d435-6abc-5252-aaa5-b88ae63a2b1c',N'936dcdff-47ab-56be-b54e-b4161e49c8e6',0,3,19,N'Question number 5',N'<p>- Đáp án là QY0918.
- Người phụ nữ đọc rõ từng ký tự
của biển số xe. Khi điền đáp án, cần
viết liền và lưu ý 0 là số không,
không phải chữ O.
- Key words: license plate number</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,5,NULL,0,1017),
(N'cc7e6a35-a604-59f5-ae7b-408bf7b2f413',N'936dcdff-47ab-56be-b54e-b4161e49c8e6',0,3,19,N'Question number 6',N'<p>- Đáp án là 12th. </p><p>- Người phụ nữ nêu rõ ngày đến và ngày đi. “Leaving on the 12th” chính là departure date. Tháng April đã có sẵn trong ngữ cảnh nên chỉ cần điền ngày. </p><p>- Key words: leaving, departure date</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,6,NULL,0,1017),
(N'6c17c5ca-14a0-56f8-85bc-547c276bf21b',N'936dcdff-47ab-56be-b54e-b4161e49c8e6',0,3,19,N'Question number 7',N'<p>- Đáp án là small. Nhân viên đưa ra ba kích cỡ hộp đựng thức ăn. Người phụ nữ muốn loại nhẹ và đồng ý ngay với lựa chọn “small size”.</p><p> - Quyết định được chốt bằng “Let''s do that.” </p><p>- Key words: bear-proof container, small size, lightweight</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,7,NULL,0,1017),
(N'63704b03-e868-5c06-8d9f-44f234f4afba',N'936dcdff-47ab-56be-b54e-b4161e49c8e6',0,3,19,N'Question number 8',N'<p>- Đáp án là flower.
- Nhân viên liệt kê ba loại nature
walk. Người phụ nữ chọn flower
walk vì cô ấy thích làm vườn. Đề đã
có sẵn từ “walk” nên chỉ điền loại
hình.
- Key words: nature walk, flower</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,8,NULL,0,1017),
(N'2006f329-691a-538d-99c5-06eca2ae3403',N'936dcdff-47ab-56be-b54e-b4161e49c8e6',0,3,19,N'Question number 9',N'<p>- Đáp án là one-year. </p><p>- Nhân viên giới thiệu hai loại park pass. Người phụ nữ đồng ý với lựa chọn được gợi ý là one-year pass vì dự định sẽ đi nhiều công viên khác. </p><p>- Key words: </p><p>+ park pass </p><p>+ one-year</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,9,NULL,0,1017),
(N'39c7af76-56f8-5831-b99e-c5407b46f20b',N'936dcdff-47ab-56be-b54e-b4161e49c8e6',0,3,19,N'Question number 10',N'<p>- Đáp án là youth.
- Nhân viên mô tả các chương trình
quyên góp, trong đó có youth
program. Người phụ nữ quyết định
chọn chương trình này vì lý do giáo
dục trẻ em.
- Key words: donation programme,
youth</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,10,NULL,0,1017),
(N'07deb7a9-b9d1-5676-9a79-58bae23fac71',N'a1ac85b0-5f51-59f7-ba13-a6206dcc93f2',0,1,14,(CAST(N'<h2>[VOL 5] Test 6 - Section 2</h2><p><span>You will hear part of a radio travel program about a tourist resort called Stanley Island. First, you have some time to look at questions 11 to 15. Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 15.</span></p><p>Welcome once again to the show where we give you travel tips on popular tourist destinations in the Pacific region. And today, our focus is on beautiful Stanley Island. Now, before we get started, a word of warning. The seaplane service to the island was discontinued last week. So, for the next month at least, the sole link to the island is provided by the old ferry service, since plans to run a hovercraft service to the island have been delayed. So what is there to see and do on Stanley Island? Well, the main tourist areas are on the north, south and east coasts of the island. </p><p>As far as recreation goes, in the south you''ll find several leisure parklands, such as Waterworld and Fantasy Island, which seem well-equipped and reasonably priced. If it''s golf you''re after, the 18-hole course in the south of the island is currently being turned into a conference centre. But don''t despair, there are two excellent courses just 30 minutes away on the east coast. The south of the island has many large resorts and hotels, with plenty of children''s activities and clubs. This part of the island caters mainly for those seeking luxury to medium-class accommodation. But the east coast has basic apartment complexes with fully-equipped kitchens, so that at least you can cook for yourself. </p><p>For those who like to get back to nature, you''ll probably find the south coast rather overdeveloped. The rainforest areas on the west coast are largely inaccessible because of the surrounding mountains. But those on the north coast are within easy reach, and a local agency runs guided treks through the jungle. If you''re into water sports, all of the areas have something to offer.</p><p><span>Before you hear the rest of the program, you have some time to look at questions 16 to 20. Now listen and answer questions 16 to 20.</span></p><p>Now, here are a few bits of advice for those visiting the island for the first time, to make your stay safer and more enjoyable. The island is generally safe, but it''s as well to take a few precautions. If you''re on any medication, bring this with you. It may not be available on the island. And it''s also a good idea for everyone to pack some insect spray in their luggage. </p><p>If you''re think' AS nvarchar(max))+N'ing of going into the more mountainous region in the west of the island, let someone know where you''re going. And remember, the reception for your mobile phone may be unreliable, so don''t depend on that. Take your own water. Don''t drink out of rivers. You''re likely to come across lots of monkeys. They''re cute, but watch out, as they can bite. Finally, when you''re back in the more inhabited areas, take a break from steak and do try the local seafood. It''s fresh and very good value.</p><p><span>That is the end of Part 2. You now have 45 seconds to check your answers to Part 2.</span></p>'),(CAST(N'<p><span>You will hear part of a radio travel program about a tourist resort called Stanley Island. First, you have some time to look at questions 11 to 15. Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 15.</span></p><p>Welcome once again to the show where we give you travel tips on popular tourist destinations in the Pacific region. And today, our focus is on beautiful Stanley Island. Now, before we get started, a word of warning. The seaplane service to the island was discontinued last week. So, for the next month at least, the sole link to the island is provided by the old ferry service, since plans to run a hovercraft service to the island have been delayed. So what is there to see and do on Stanley Island? Well, the main tourist areas are on the north, south and east coasts of the island. </p><p>As far as recreation goes, in the south you''ll find several leisure parklands, such as Waterworld and Fantasy Island, which seem well-equipped and reasonably priced. If it''s golf you''re after, the 18-hole course in the south of the island is currently being turned into a conference centre. But don''t despair, there are two excellent courses just 30 minutes away on the east coast. The south of the island has many large resorts and hotels, with plenty of children''s activities and clubs. This part of the island caters mainly for those seeking luxury to medium-class accommodation. But the east coast has basic apartment complexes with fully-equipped kitchens, so that at least you can cook for yourself. </p><p>For those who like to get back to nature, you''ll probably find the south coast rather overdeveloped. The rainforest areas on the west coast are largely inaccessible because of the surrounding mountains. But those on the north coast are within easy reach, and a local agency runs guided treks through the jungle. If you''re into water sports, all of the areas have something to offer.</p><p><span>Before you hear the rest of the program, you have some time to look at questions 16 to 20. Now listen and answer questions 16 to 20.</span></p><p>Now, here are a few bits of advice for those visiting the island for the first time, to make your stay safer and more enjoyable. The island is generally safe, but it''s as well to take a few precautions. If you''re on any medication, bring this with you. It may not be available on the island. And it''s also a good idea for everyone to pack some insect spray in their luggage. </p><p>If you''re thinking of going into the more mountain' AS nvarchar(max))+N'ous region in the west of the island, let someone know where you''re going. And remember, the reception for your mobile phone may be unreliable, so don''t depend on that. Take your own water. Don''t drink out of rivers. You''re likely to come across lots of monkeys. They''re cute, but watch out, as they can bite. Finally, when you''re back in the more inhabited areas, take a break from steak and do try the local seafood. It''s fresh and very good value.</p><p><span>That is the end of Part 2. You now have 45 seconds to check your answers to Part 2.</span></p>'),NULL,N'https://ieltsroom.com/upload/audio/iL-full-test/ieltsadvancedtest/vol-5/iL.VOL5.6.S1017.PART2.mp3',NULL,1,0,2,NULL,0,1017),
(N'635d9203-e3f4-52f6-bf0b-a59bcd49c8b5',N'07deb7a9-b9d1-5676-9a79-58bae23fac71',0,2,18,N'<p>Choose the correct letter, <span>A</span>, <span>B</span> or <span>C</span>.</p>',N'',N'',N'',N'',1,0,1,NULL,0,1017),
(N'1bb37817-9d8c-5371-8954-5f83d18bca1e',N'635d9203-e3f4-52f6-bf0b-a59bcd49c8b5',0,3,19,N'<p>At the present time, Stanley Island can be reached by</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là C (ferry).
- Bài nghe khẳng định dịch vụ
seaplane đã bị ngừng từ tuần
trước, còn kế hoạch chạy
hovercraft thì bị trì hoãn.
- Vì vậy, ở thời điểm hiện tại,
phương tiện duy nhất để tới
Stanley Island là ferry.
- Key words: at the present time;
sole link; ferry service</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,11,NULL,0,1017),
(N'febab7f9-665b-5d8d-a6b8-a346edbddecb',N'07deb7a9-b9d1-5676-9a79-58bae23fac71',0,2,18,N'<p>Where can the following facilities and attractions be found?
Write the correct letter, <span>A</span>, <span>B</span> or <span>C</span>, next to questions 12-15.</p>',N'',N'',N'',N'Answer choices',15,0,2,NULL,0,1017),
(N'da373659-24d8-596e-b4f0-f4ec07d9069c',N'febab7f9-665b-5d8d-a6b8-a346edbddecb',0,3,19,N'<p>golf courses</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là C (The East Coast). Sân golf ở phía nam hiện không còn hoạt động vì đang được chuyển thành trung tâm hội nghị. - Người nói nhấn mạnh rằng các sân golf hiện nay nằm ở bờ đông của đảo. </p><p>- Key words: golf; courses; east coast </p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,12,NULL,0,1017),
(N'812d4767-b2a8-54c1-abbc-72c854a995a6',N'febab7f9-665b-5d8d-a6b8-a346edbddecb',0,3,19,N'<p>family hotels</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là B (The South Coast). </p><p>- Các khách sạn lớn, nhiều hoạt động cho trẻ em và phù hợp cho gia đình đều tập trung ở phía nam. Điều này khớp trực tiếp với khái niệm family hotels. </p><p>- Key words: large resorts; hotels; children’s activities </p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,13,NULL,0,1017),
(N'ac8d9601-825a-58f8-a57b-5209d62c7bb7',N'febab7f9-665b-5d8d-a6b8-a346edbddecb',0,3,19,N'<p>self-catering flats</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là C (The East Coast). Self-catering flats được nhận diện qua đặc điểm có bếp đầy đủ để tự nấu ăn, và chi tiết này chỉ xuất hiện khi người nói mô tả bờ đông. </p><p>- Key words: self-catering; apartments; cook for yourself </p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,14,NULL,0,1017),
(N'64592b85-8984-5f99-b801-79352bb4d650',N'febab7f9-665b-5d8d-a6b8-a346edbddecb',0,3,19,N'<p>nature walks</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là A (The North Coast). Nature walks gắn với rừng rậm và các tour trekking có hướng dẫn, được nhắc rõ là nằm ở bờ bắc. Bờ nam bị loại vì quá phát triển. </p><p>- Key words: nature; guided treks; north coast </p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,15,NULL,0,1017),
(N'94594830-1bdf-5bcd-a09a-82b22bb8f008',N'07deb7a9-b9d1-5676-9a79-58bae23fac71',0,2,18,N'<p>Complete the notes below.
Write <span>NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS</span> for each answer.</p>',N'',N'',N'',N'Advice to Visitors',11,0,3,NULL,0,1017),
(N'b2d9b8b3-bc7b-544e-9e9a-63dc914efe97',N'94594830-1bdf-5bcd-a09a-82b22bb8f008',0,3,19,N'<h3>Advice to Visitors</h3><table border="1"><tbody><tr><td><p>• Bring your own }{SPACE}{ and insect spray.</p> <p>• It may not be possible to use your }{SPACE}{ in the western area.</p> <p>• Don''t drink water from }{SPACE}{ </p> <p>• Be careful of the }{SPACE}{ as they bite.</p> <p>• Try the local }{SPACE}{ </p></td></tr></tbody></table>',N'<p>- Đáp án là medication. Người nói
khuyên du khách nên mang theo
thuốc cá nhân vì trên đảo có thể
không mua được. Cấu trúc đề là
“Bring your own ... and insect
spray” nên từ cần điền là
medication.
- Key words: bring with you;
medication</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,16,NULL,0,1017),
(N'761a429a-cf09-5169-aae5-ffaa6ec2350e',N'94594830-1bdf-5bcd-a09a-82b22bb8f008',0,3,19,N'Question number 17',N'<p>- Đáp án là mobile phone. Người nói cảnh báo sóng điện thoại ở khu vực phía tây không ổn định, vì vậy không nên phụ thuộc vào điện thoại. Điều này khớp trực tiếp với cấu trúc “use your ...”. </p><p>Key words: reception; unreliable; mobile phone </p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,17,NULL,0,1017),
(N'e80b7f89-1a72-5f91-9d96-8c60f67b5129',N'94594830-1bdf-5bcd-a09a-82b22bb8f008',0,3,19,N'Question number 18',N'<p>- Đáp án là rivers. Người nói đưa
