t to which 20th century European artists were influenced by them. But that''s beyond the scope of my presentation, I think. Yes. What about the sources of the materials they used? You don''t mention that anywhere. I didn''t manage to find out much about that. I want to cover the theories about who the original sculptors were, though. Yes, the idea that a lot of them may have been made by the same person. That''s very interesting. It is, isn''t it? Rig'+N'ht. Well, thanks for all the advice. Now I think I need to work...</p><p><span><span>That is the end of Part 3. You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to Part 3.</span></span></p>'),NULL,N'https://ieltsroom.com/upload/audio/iL-full-test/ieltsadvancedtest/vol-5/iL.VOL5.6.S1017.PART3.mp3',NULL,1,0,3,NULL,0,1017),
(N'96e3fe04-cb9f-5991-a8c0-d28f47005463',N'd01f8f49-0d10-5ad0-a6d9-0cfa7f7f337d',0,2,18,N'<p>Choose the correct letter, <span>A, B or C.</span></p>',N'',N'',N'',N'',1,0,1,NULL,0,1017),
(N'4d04a230-e2fb-5a3a-8e4f-ec38f7a3880b',N'96e3fe04-cb9f-5991-a8c0-d28f47005463',0,3,19,N'<p>What first attracted Terence to the topic of Ife sculptures?</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là B (He attended an exhibition). </p><p>- Terrence thừa nhận anh đã đọc các bài báo học thuật, nhưng nhấn mạnh ban đầu anh tiếp cận chủ đề này qua một buổi trưng bày đặc biệt tại bảo tàng thành phố. </p><p>- Cụm “initially I got my introduction” cho thấy đây chính là điều thu hút anh đầu tiên. </p><p>- Key words: initially; special display; city museum</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,21,NULL,0,1017),
