(N'f1427839-fe1d-5788-b361-b74be98c95ce',N'dc91aa3c-75b0-5db2-a1c0-406b034dbcc1',0,3,19,N'<p>Which<span> TWO</span> features of his research in Nigeria will Terence discuss in his presentation? </p>',N'<p>- Một đáp án là B (the uncertainty
