(N'22d543a8-6d79-5a66-8acc-06d254637609',N'bb8f147f-b095-59c4-8808-0a7b69b4687c',0,3,19,N'<h3>Australian Overseas Relocation Agency</h3><table border="1"><tbody><tr><td><p><span>Personal information</span></p> <p>• Name: Helen Green</p> <p>• Current address: 42 }{SPACE}{ Road, Kew, London</p> <p>• Telephone: }{SPACE}{ </p> <p>• Relocation to: Brisbane</p> <p>• Employer: Kirkby Technology</p> <p>• Will move in: early }{SPACE}{ </p> <p><span>Accommodation</span></p> <p>• type of accommodation required at first: a central }{SPACE}{ </p> <p>• preferred location: near a }{SPACE}{ </p> <p>• client will need }{SPACE}{ for the accommodation</p> <p><span>Schooling</span></p> <p>• client''s son: to go into grade }{SPACE}{ </p> <p>• type of school: high school (preferably }{SPACE}{ </p> <p>• client to send the child''s }{SPACE}{ </p> <p><span>The client would also like:</span></p> <p>• information about a chess club for her son</p> <p>• to play in a }{SPACE}{ </p></td></tr></tbody></table>',N'<p>- Đáp án là Station.
