(N'b9f7118a-aa24-5e20-91f3-4e88fdde77a1',N'cca4b77e-912a-5658-8cc7-8ca39103edd8',0,3,19,N'<p>What is Katrina most looking forward to in the project?</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là B.
