(N'7ebdceea-2df1-5540-b895-337113da08dd',N'68e6b1c1-4980-5112-9f87-46fb5fdeff5a',0,3,19,N'<p>How has relaxation increased managers'' productivity?</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là C.
