+ not distracted</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,16,NULL,0,1015),
(N'bd25498f-2bd1-514a-9f3c-5fa27f22a94f',N'68e6b1c1-4980-5112-9f87-46fb5fdeff5a',0,3,19,N'<p>Janice says managers'' decision-making benefits from relaxation because</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là A.
