- Key words:
+ other people''s point of view
+ benefit from advice</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,17,NULL,0,1015),
(N'a2550e59-168d-51be-8b74-45af0d90c41c',N'68e6b1c1-4980-5112-9f87-46fb5fdeff5a',0,3,19,N'<p>Janice thinks that relaxation classes improve relationships at work because staff</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là C.
