(N'b70755d0-5c16-5b14-ae9f-6f2af655f233',N'68e6b1c1-4980-5112-9f87-46fb5fdeff5a',0,3,19,N'<p>What are employees being offered at first?</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là B.
