(N'00acdad6-7b32-5e5a-bca6-6d8fdc8c8334',N'68e6b1c1-4980-5112-9f87-46fb5fdeff5a',0,3,19,N'<p>People taking part in the sessions are advised to</p>',N'<p>- Đáp án là A.
