 minimum age for the job? I just turned 19, would that be a problem?</p><p><span><span>Man:</span></span> We would prefer someone over the age of 21, but applicants over 18 are also considered if they can prove that they are mature, capable and able to work safely.</p><p><span><span>Woman:</span></span> Are there any other requirements I would need to fulfil?</p><p><span><span>Man:</span></span> If we hire you, you would also need to register with the police department here in the UK, since you are not a British citizen. I think the fee is about £36. Is there anything else you want to ask?</p><p><span><span>Woman:</span></span> I guess that''s pretty much what I need to know.</p><p><span><span>Man:</span></span> Cool, you will hear from us sometime next week, as we have some other applicants to interview at the moment. Thank you for coming in today.</p><p><span><span>Woman:</span></span> Ok, I look forward to hearing from you. Thank you for taking the time to meet with me today.</p>'),NULL,N'https://ieltsroom.com/upload/audio/iL-full-test/ieltsadvancedtest/vol-5/iL.VOL5.3.S1014.PART1.mp3',NULL,1,0,1,NULL,0,1014),
(N'2f98b2e6-0306-5d72-a0b3-de30d5f8ee94',N'f3429648-ed5f-5d15-9e98-f53aaee7816e',0,2,18,N'<p>Complete the notes below.
Write <span>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</span> for each answer.</p>',N'',N'',N'',N'Camp counsellor',11,0,1,NULL,0,1014),
(N'7608e6a0-d82c-5cb2-a4d2-95230f78dd83',N'2f98b2e6-0306-5d72-a0b3-de30d5f8ee94',0,3,19,N'<h3>Camp counsellor</h3><table border="1"><tbody><tr><td><p><span>Job description</span></p> <p>• Act as a }{SPACE}{ among summer camp attendees.</p> <p>• Specialized in }{SPACE}{ </p> <p><span>Schedule</span></p> <p>• Length of summer camp: }{SPACE}{ weeks.</p> <p>• The camp will commence in }{SPACE}{ </p> <ul><li><p></p></li></ul> }{SPACE}{ is needed for the first week.</p> <p><span>Staff welfare policy</span></p> <p>• Total salary: £ }{SPACE}{ </p> <p>• The company will not pay for staff''s }{SPACE}{ </p> <p>• Perk: staff }{SPACE}{ on some travel products.</p> <p><span>Requirements</span></p> <p>• Age limit: at least }{SPACE}{ years old.</p> <p>• The }{SPACE}{ department requires foreigners who work in the UK to register there. </p></td></tr></tbody></table>',N'<p>- Đáp án là leader. </p><p>- Người đàn ông nói rõ họ đang tìm một người lãnh đạo cho nhóm trẻ em tham gia trại hè. </p><p>- Key words: </p><p>+ leader: người lãnh đạo </p><p>+ group of children: nhóm trẻ em</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,0,1014),
(N'a41abd14-f373-5b51-a861-4af1bae18728',N'2f98b2e6-0306-5d72-a0b3-de30d5f8ee94',0,3,19,N'Question number 2',N'<p>- Đáp án là tennis. </p><p>- Người đàn ông nói rõ vị trí này cần chuyên môn về tennis. </p><p>- Key words: </p><p>+ specialist in tennis: chuyên về tennis </p><p>+ teach the children: dạy trẻ em</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,2,NULL,0,1014),
(N'6b014fbb-e12b-556e-9f65-b31ed2ee4f4d',N'2f98b2e6-0306-5d72-a0b3-de30d5f8ee94',0,3,19,N'Question number 3',N'<p>- Đáp án là 8. </p><p>- Thời gian trại hè được trả lời trực tiếp là 8 tuần. </p><p>- Key words: </p><p>+ will only take: chỉ kéo dài </p><p>+ 8 weeks: 8 tuần</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,3,NULL,0,1014),
(N'99b1f993-580c-5c98-b052-73c61e3f6f36',N'2f98b2e6-0306-5d72-a0b3-de30d5f8ee94',0,3,19,N'Question number 4',N'<p>Đáp án là June. </p><p>- Người đàn ông sửa thông tin và nói rõ trại bắt đầu vào tháng 6.</p><p>- Key words: </p><p>+ begin at the start of June: bắt đầu đầu tháng 6</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,4,NULL,0,1014),
(N'5040b83e-89bf-5c77-83c7-38d50833bfad',N'2f98b2e6-0306-5d72-a0b3-de30d5f8ee94',0,3,19,N'Question number 5',N'<p>- Đáp án là training. </p><p>- Tuần đầu tiên bắt buộc tham gia đào tạo. </p><p>- Key words: </p><p>+ training: đào tạo </p><p>+ first week: tuần đầu tiên</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,5,NULL,0,1014),
(N'ef47f084-3a03-5ce6-8c23-8865ab02c443',N'2f98b2e6-0306-5d72-a0b3-de30d5f8ee94',0,3,19,N'Question number 6',N'<p>- Đáp án là 985. </p><p>- Người đàn ông trả lời trực tiếp tổng lương sau 8 tuần là £985. </p><p>- Key words: </p><p>+ after week 8: sau 8 tuần </p><p>+ receive £985: nhận £985</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,6,NULL,0,1014);
