(N'c48d3de5-2a68-5638-8e25-b92707c8fdd8',N'e2c21496-70e8-52eb-a826-205beb09bda7',0,3,19,N'<h3>USA RESEARCH PROJECTS</h3><table border="1"><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span>State</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span>Schools involved</span></p></td><td><p><span>Number of students</span></p></td><td><p><span>Key findings</span></p></td><td><p><span>Problems</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>Tennessee</span></span></p></td><td><p>about 70 schools</p></td><td><p>in total }{SPACE}{ </p></td><td><p>stronger benefits for  }{SPACE}{ pupils</p></td><td><p>lack of agreement on implications of data </p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>California</span></p></td><td> }{SPACE}{ schools</p></td><td><p>1.8 million</p></td><td><p>very little benefit </p></td><td><p>shortage of }{SPACE}{ especially in poorer areas </p> <p>no proper method for  }{SPACE}{ of project</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>Wisconsin</span></p></td><td><p>14 schools (pupils from  }{SPACE}{ families</p></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>',N'<p>- Đáp án là 12,000.</p><p> - Đây là tổng số học sinh tham gia nghiên cứu Tennessee sau khi dự án kết thúc.</p><p> - Key words: </p><p>+ total number: total number</p><p> + grown to: tăng tới</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,25,NULL,0,1012),
