(N'9da898da-c074-5ebd-a86c-77ff0b400bd4',N'8fe99f9e-05ef-5dfa-bf80-2b55c4f36cdc',0,3,19,N'<h3>How to make cheese</h3><table border="1"><tbody><tr><td><p>The process of making cheese is to add microorganisms into milk. People think the process originated from Southwest  }{SPACE}{ about 8,000 years ago.</p> <p>The two main kinds of cheeses were called }{SPACE}{ and salty cheeses.</p> <p>The }{SPACE}{ Romans were great pioneers in cheese-making.</p> <p>The new skills began to spread between  }{SPACE}{ and 300AD.</p> <p><span>Evolution of cheese making</span></p> <ul><li><p><span>Early Stage</span></p></li></ul> <p>It was known cheeses'' tastes were related to }{SPACE}{ and the environment. </p> <ul><li><p><span>19th Century</span></p></li></ul> <p>The }{SPACE}{ microorganism increased.</p> <p>It was possible to }{SPACE}{ the process.</p> <ul><li><p><span>At Present</span></p></li></ul> <p>Cheeses began being made largely in }{SPACE}{ </p> <p>, but }{SPACE}{ judgment is still important.</p> <p>Despite the scale of production, }{SPACE}{ and technology can still develop. </p></td></tr></tbody></table>',N'<p>- Đáp án là Asia. </p><p>- Cụm “Southwest Asia” xuất hiện trực tiếp trong bài nói, đúng với chỗ trống “Southwest ___”. </p><p>- Key words: </p><p>+ came from: đến từ </p><p>+ Southwest Asia: Tây Nam Á </p><p>+ originated: xuất phát từ</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,31,NULL,0,1012),
