records. Where did you hear about us?</p><p><span>Susan:</span><br>You''re calling—</p><p>That is the end of Section One.</p><p>You now have half a minute to check your answers.</p><p>Now turn to Section Two on page three.</p>'),NULL,N'https://ieltsroom.com/upload/audio/iL-full-test/ieltsadvancedtest/real-tests/iL.REAL.2.S484.S484.PART1.mp3',NULL,1,0,1,NULL,0,484),
(N'3243153a-b67b-55f8-9fe2-2efb7de363b1',N'7b405f83-e83e-5a47-b6e2-8a3f92e67f42',0,2,18,N'<p><span><span>Complete the notes below.</span></span></p><p><span><span>Write <span>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER </span>for each answer.</span></span></p>',N'',N'',N'',N'Rental Property Application Form',11,0,1,NULL,0,484),
(N'6fe6aa1a-016f-523d-8e5a-ad3f36883885',N'3243153a-b67b-55f8-9fe2-2efb7de363b1',0,3,19,N'<h3>Rental Property Application Form</h3><table border="1"><tbody><tr><td><p><em><span>Example</span></em></p><p><span>Name:Susan <span>Smith</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td>Phone number: }{SPACE}{ (mobile) Email address: Susansmith@  }{SPACE}{  <p>Current address: 234 Becketts Road</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Brisbane. 4054</p><p>New Zealand Employers:&nbsp;Auckland Hospital</p> Occupation: a  }{SPACE}{  <p>Rental start date: 8th February</p><p>Preferred property type:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p> •	First preference: a house with a  }{SPACE}{  •	Second preference: an apartment with a big  }{SPACE}{  <p>Bedroom: two</p> Furnishings: a  }{SPACE}{ is required Maximum rent: $  }{SPACE}{ per week Preferred location: near the  }{SPACE}{  <p>Other requirements:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p> •	must have  }{SPACE}{ nearby •	Would like  }{SPACE}{ included in the rent</td></tr></tbody></table>',N'Susan đọc số di động “61 438 199 7”',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,1,NULL,0,484),
