(N'7d8c695b-923d-5366-b4f6-357a7e900ec1',N'd48ea504-7705-548c-8aa0-1df23a50c4f5',0,3,19,N'Which TWO treatment techniques did the female runner find useful for her swollen heel?',N'deep tissue massage tạo “freedom of movement”. Ice và ultrasound không hiệu quả, balancing exercises cô ấy không tin.',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,28,NULL,0,484),
